      "name": "links - 4"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "title": "Agents",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 9,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{ws}"
              ],
              "parameters": [
                {
                  "id": "21bcdc47-1769-42c8-b81f-f9e709bf1c63",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "SanctionedAgents",
                  "label": "🌱 Sanctioned AI Agents",
                  "type": 2,
                  "description": "Approved AI agent and tool identities. Select public catalogue entries or use the separate AIAgentGovernance watchlist rows marked Sanctioned=TRUE for automatic selection.",
                  "isGlobal": true,
                  "multiSelect": true,
                  "quote": "'",
                  "delimiter": ",",
                  "query": "let PublicAgentData =\n    externaldata(\n        Name:string,\n        Category:string,\n        MatchField:string,\n        Pattern:string,\n        MatchType:string,\n        RiskLevel:string,\n        DefaultAction:string,\n        Reason:string,\n        SourceURL:string,\n        Vendor:string,\n        SourceFrom:string,\n        TelemetrySource:string\n    )\n    [\n        @\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quorumcyber-workbooks/workbooks/main/Files/QCDataTypes/ai_agent_watchlist.csv\"\n    ]\n    with (\n        format=\"csv\",\n        ignoreFirstRecord=true\n    )\n    | extend\n        AgentName = tostring(Name),\n        AgentKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(Name)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            ),\n        AgentOrigin = tostring(SourceFrom),\n        Sanctioned = false,\n        CatalogueSource = \"Public\",\n        SourcePriority = 1;\n\nlet LocalAgentData =\n    Watchlist\n    | where WatchlistAlias == \"AIAgentGovernance\"\n    | summarize arg_max(LastUpdatedTimeUTC, *) by SearchKey\n    | where isnotempty(WatchlistItem)\n    | extend W = todynamic(WatchlistItem)\n    | extend\n        AgentName = tostring(coalesce(W.AgentName, W.Name, W.Product, W.Key)),\n        AgentPolicyKey = tostring(coalesce(W.PolicyKey, W.Key)),\n        Vendor = tostring(coalesce(W.Vendor, W.Provider)),\n        Category = tostring(W.Category),\n        AgentOrigin = tostring(coalesce(W.From, W.AgentOrigin)),\n        Sanctioned = tobool(W.Sanctioned),\n        SourceURL = tostring(W.SourceURL)\n    | extend\n        AgentKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(\n                    iff(\n                        isnotempty(AgentPolicyKey),\n                        AgentPolicyKey,\n                        AgentName\n                    )\n                ),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            ),\n        CatalogueSource = \"Local Watchlist\",\n        SourcePriority = 2\n    | where isnotempty(AgentKey)\n    | project\n        AgentName,\n        AgentKey,\n        Vendor,\n        Category,\n        AgentOrigin,\n        Sanctioned,\n        SourceURL,\n        CatalogueSource,\n        SourcePriority;\n\nlet AgentData =\n    union\n        PublicAgentData,\n        LocalAgentData\n    | where isnotempty(AgentKey)\n    | summarize\n        arg_max(SourcePriority, *)\n      by\n        AgentKey;\n\nAgentData\n| summarize\n    AgentName = take_any(AgentName),\n    Vendor = take_any(Vendor),\n    Category = take_any(Category),\n    AgentOrigin = take_any(AgentOrigin),\n    HasLocal = countif(CatalogueSource == \"Local Watchlist\") > 0,\n    IsSelected = countif(CatalogueSource == \"Local Watchlist\" and Sanctioned == true) > 0\n  by\n    AgentKey\n| extend\n    Label =\n        strcat(\n            AgentName,\n            iff(\n                isnotempty(Vendor),\n                strcat(\" - \", Vendor),\n                \"\"\n            ),\n            iff(\n                HasLocal,\n                \" [Local]\",\n                \"\"\n            )\n        )\n| project\n    Value = AgentKey,\n    Label,\n    selected = IsSelected\n| order by Label asc",
                  "crossComponentResources": [
                    "{ws}"
                  ],
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [],
                    "showDefault": false
                  },
                  "timeContext": {
                    "durationMs": 0
                  },
                  "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
                  "queryType": 0,
                  "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
                },
                {
                  "id": "6b59c3aa-9ffe-4de8-83b4-ccf626b8aa59",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "SanctionedAgentsCount",
                  "type": 1,
                  "query": "resources\r\n| take 1\r\n| project SanctionedAgentsCount =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(\"{SanctionedAgents}\"),\r\n        0,\r\n        array_length(split(\"{SanctionedAgents}\", \",\"))\r\n    )",
                  "crossComponentResources": [
                    "value::all"
                  ],
                  "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
                  "queryType": 1,
                  "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
                }
              ],
              "style": "above",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
            },
            "customWidth": "25",
            "name": "parameters - agents"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "> ### 🤖 Configure Sanctioned AI Agents\n>\n> **Select the AI agents and tools approved for use within your organisation.** If a Sentinel watchlist with alias **AIAgentGovernance** is present, local entries are merged with the public catalogue and rows marked `Sanctioned=TRUE` are selected automatically. Local catalogue entries are shown with **[Local]**.\n>\n> 🟢 **Sanctioned** — activity mapped to an approved AI agent or tool policy.\n>\n> 🔴 **Unsanctioned** — recognised AI agent or tool activity not mapped to an approved policy.\n>\n> ⚠️ **If no agents are selected, all recognised AI agent and tool activity will be classified as unsanctioned.**\n\nThe workbook primarily uses:\n**DeviceProcessEvents** — execution of recognised local AI agents, model hosts and related tooling.\n**OfficeActivity** — Microsoft 365 and Purview audit activity associated with cloud agents.\n**AuditLogs** — Microsoft Entra audit activity associated with cloud agents.\n**AADServicePrincipalSignInLogs** — Microsoft Entra service-principal sign-in activity associated with cloud agents.\n\nThe optional **AIAgentGovernance** watchlist can add customer-specific AI agents and tools, override matching public catalogue evidence, and define default sanctioned selections. The workbook continues to operate with the public catalogue when the watchlist is absent. Cloud sources are queried opportunistically; unavailable tables are ignored."
            },
            "customWidth": "70",
            "name": "text - 19"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ============================================================\n// AI AGENT / TOOL DETECTION\n//\n// Reads ai_agent_watchlist.csv.\n// Matches LOCAL agents and runtimes against DeviceProcessEvents.\n//\n// Cloud rows are excluded because cloud agents require separate\n// telemetry such as OfficeActivity, Security Copilot, Entra,\n// Purview, or vendor APIs.\n// ============================================================\n\n// ============================================================\n// AI AGENT WATCHLIST\n// ============================================================\n\nlet AgentWatchlist =\n    externaldata(\n        Name:string,\n        Category:string,\n        MatchField:string,\n        Pattern:string,\n        MatchType:string,\n        RiskLevel:string,\n        DefaultAction:string,\n        Reason:string,\n        SourceURL:string,\n        Vendor:string,\n        SourceFrom:string,\n        TelemetrySource:string\n    )\n    [\n        @\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quorumcyber-workbooks/workbooks/main/Files/QCDataTypes/ai_agent_watchlist.csv\"\n    ]\n    with (\n        format=\"csv\",\n        ignoreFirstRecord=true\n    )\n    | extend\n        SearchPattern =\n            tolower(\n                case(\n                    MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                        replace_string(\n                            replace_string(Pattern, \"*\", \"\"),\n                            \"?\",\n                            \"\"\n                        ),\n                    Pattern\n                )\n            )\n    | where SourceFrom =~ \"Local\"\n    | where MatchField in~ (\n        \"FileName\",\n        \"ProcessCommandLine\"\n    )\n    | where TelemetrySource contains \"DeviceProcessEvents\"\n    | where isnotempty(SearchPattern);\n\n// ============================================================\n// SANCTIONED AI AGENT POLICY KEYS\n// ============================================================\nlet SanctionedAgents =\n    dynamic([{SanctionedAgents}]);\n\nlet SelectedAgentKeys =\n    toscalar(\n        print SelectedValue = SanctionedAgents\n        | mv-expand SelectedValue\n        | extend SelectedKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(SelectedValue)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            )\n        | where isnotempty(SelectedKey)\n        | summarize make_set(SelectedKey, 500)\n    );\n\n// ============================================================\n// BUILD SEARCH LIST\n// ============================================================\n\nlet WatchPatterns =\n    toscalar(\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | summarize make_set(SearchPattern, 500)\n    );\n\n// ============================================================\n// CANDIDATE PROCESS EVENTS\n// ============================================================\nlet CandidateProcesses =\n    DeviceProcessEvents\n    | where Timestamp between (\n        {TimeRange:start}\n        ..\n        {TimeRange:end}\n    )\n    | where isnotempty(DeviceName)\n    | extend\n        FileNameLower =\n            tolower(\n                coalesce(\n                    FileName,\n                    \"\"\n                )\n            ),\n        CommandLineLower =\n            tolower(\n                coalesce(\n                    ProcessCommandLine,\n                    \"\"\n                )\n            ),\n        SearchText =\n            tolower(\n                strcat(\n                    FileName,\n                    \" \",\n                    FolderPath,\n                    \" \",\n                    ProcessCommandLine,\n                    \" \",\n                    ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n                    \" \",\n                    ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName\n                )\n            )\n    | where SearchText has_any(WatchPatterns)\n    | extend\n        EventKey =\n            strcat(\n                tostring(Timestamp),\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(DeviceId),\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(FileName),\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(ProcessCommandLine)\n            )\n    | project\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User =\n            tostring(\n                coalesce(\n                    InitiatingProcessAccountUpn,\n                    InitiatingProcessAccountName\n                )\n            ),\n        FileName,\n        FileNameLower,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n        CommandLineLower,\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// FILENAME MATCHES\n// ============================================================\n\nlet FileNameMatches =\n    CandidateProcesses\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\n    | join kind=inner (\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | where MatchField =~ \"FileName\"\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\n    ) on JoinKey\n    | extend\n        IsMatch =\n            case(\n                MatchType =~ \"Exact\",\n                    FileNameLower == SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Contains\",\n                    FileNameLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                    FileNameLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Prefix\",\n                    FileNameLower startswith SearchPattern,\n\n                false\n            )\n    | where IsMatch\n    | extend\n        MatchedOn = \"FileName\"\n    | project\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User,\n\n        Name,\n        Category,\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n        SourceURL,\n        Vendor,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n\n        MatchedOn,\n        Pattern,\n\n        FileName,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// COMMAND-LINE MATCHES\n// ============================================================\n\nlet CommandLineMatches =\n    CandidateProcesses\n    | where isnotempty(ProcessCommandLine)\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\n    | join kind=inner (\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | where MatchField =~ \"ProcessCommandLine\"\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\n    ) on JoinKey\n    | extend\n        IsMatch =\n            case(\n                MatchType =~ \"Exact\",\n                    CommandLineLower == SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Contains\",\n                    CommandLineLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                    CommandLineLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Prefix\",\n                    CommandLineLower startswith SearchPattern,\n\n                false\n            )\n    | where IsMatch\n    | extend\n        MatchedOn = \"ProcessCommandLine\"\n    | project\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User,\n        Name,\n        Category,\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n        SourceURL,\n        Vendor,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n\n        MatchedOn,\n        Pattern,\n\n        FileName,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// COMBINE AND DEDUPLICATE EVENT MATCHES\n// ============================================================\n\nlet EventMatches =\n    union\n        FileNameMatches,\n        CommandLineMatches\n    | summarize\n        MatchedFields =\n            make_set(\n                MatchedOn,\n                10\n            ),\n\n        MatchedPatterns =\n            make_set(\n                Pattern,\n                50\n            ),\n\n        MatchedSources =\n            make_set(\n                SourceURL,\n                10\n            )\n      by\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User,\n\n        Name,\n        Vendor,\n        Category,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n\n        FileName,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n\n        SHA256;\n\n\n// ============================================================\n// LOCAL AI AGENT GOVERNANCE AT A GLANCE\n// ============================================================\nlet LocalObservedAgents =\n    EventMatches\n    | extend AgentKey = replace_regex(tolower(tostring(Name)), \"[^a-z0-9]\", \"\")\n    | summarize by AgentKey;\nlet LocalConfiguredCount =\n    toscalar(\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | extend AgentKey = replace_regex(tolower(tostring(Name)), \"[^a-z0-9]\", \"\")\n        | where SourceFrom =~ \"Local\"\n        | where set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, AgentKey)\n        | summarize dcount(AgentKey)\n    );\nlet LocalSanctionedObserved =\n    toscalar(\n        LocalObservedAgents\n        | where set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, AgentKey)\n        | summarize dcount(AgentKey)\n    );\nlet LocalUnsanctionedObserved =\n    toscalar(\n        LocalObservedAgents\n        | where set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, AgentKey) == false\n        | summarize dcount(AgentKey)\n    );\nlet LocalSanctionedNotObserved =\n    iff(LocalConfiguredCount > LocalSanctionedObserved, LocalConfiguredCount - LocalSanctionedObserved, 0);\nunion\n    (print SortOrder = 1, Metric = \"🟢 Sanctioned Agents Observed\", Value = tolong(LocalSanctionedObserved), Detail = \"Selected local agents with evidence in the period\"),\n    (print SortOrder = 2, Metric = \"🔴 Unsanctioned Agents Observed\", Value = tolong(LocalUnsanctionedObserved), Detail = \"Recognised local agents not in the selection\"),\n    (print SortOrder = 3, Metric = \"⚪ Sanctioned Agents Not Observed\", Value = tolong(LocalSanctionedNotObserved), Detail = \"Selected local agents with no evidence in the period\")\n| order by SortOrder asc\n| project Metric, Value, Detail",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "📊 Local AI Agent Governance at a Glance",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{ws}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Metric",
                  "formatter": 1
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "none"
                  },
                  "numberFormat": {
                    "unit": 17,
                    "options": {
                      "style": "decimal",
                      "maximumFractionDigits": 0,
                      "maximumSignificantDigits": 3
                    }
                  }
                },
                "showBorder": false
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "query - Local Agent Governance at a Glance"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ============================================================\n// AI AGENT / TOOL DETECTION\n//\n// Reads ai_agent_watchlist.csv.\n// Matches LOCAL agents and runtimes against DeviceProcessEvents.\n//\n// Cloud rows are excluded because cloud agents require separate\n// telemetry such as OfficeActivity, Security Copilot, Entra,\n// Purview, or vendor APIs.\n// ============================================================\n\n// ============================================================\n// AI AGENT WATCHLIST\n// ============================================================\n\nlet AgentWatchlist =\n    externaldata(\n        Name:string,\n        Category:string,\n        MatchField:string,\n        Pattern:string,\n        MatchType:string,\n        RiskLevel:string,\n        DefaultAction:string,\n        Reason:string,\n        SourceURL:string,\n        Vendor:string,\n        SourceFrom:string,\n        TelemetrySource:string\n    )\n    [\n        @\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quorumcyber-workbooks/workbooks/main/Files/QCDataTypes/ai_agent_watchlist.csv\"\n    ]\n    with (\n        format=\"csv\",\n        ignoreFirstRecord=true\n    )\n    | extend\n        SearchPattern =\n            tolower(\n                case(\n                    MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                        replace_string(\n                            replace_string(Pattern, \"*\", \"\"),\n                            \"?\",\n                            \"\"\n                        ),\n                    Pattern\n                )\n            )\n    | where SourceFrom =~ \"Local\"\n    | where MatchField in~ (\n        \"FileName\",\n        \"ProcessCommandLine\"\n    )\n    | where TelemetrySource contains \"DeviceProcessEvents\"\n    | where isnotempty(SearchPattern);\n\n// ============================================================\n// SANCTIONED AI AGENT POLICY KEYS\n// ============================================================\nlet SanctionedAgents =\n    dynamic([{SanctionedAgents}]);\n\nlet SelectedAgentKeys =\n    toscalar(\n        print SelectedValue = SanctionedAgents\n        | mv-expand SelectedValue\n        | extend SelectedKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(SelectedValue)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            )\n        | where isnotempty(SelectedKey)\n        | summarize make_set(SelectedKey, 500)\n    );\n\n// ============================================================\n// BUILD SEARCH LIST\n// ============================================================\n\nlet WatchPatterns =\n    toscalar(\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | summarize make_set(SearchPattern, 500)\n    );\n\n// ============================================================\n// CANDIDATE PROCESS EVENTS\n// ============================================================\nlet CandidateProcesses =\n    DeviceProcessEvents\n    | where Timestamp between (\n        {TimeRange:start}\n        ..\n        {TimeRange:end}\n    )\n    | where isnotempty(DeviceName)\n    | extend\n        FileNameLower =\n            tolower(\n                coalesce(\n                    FileName,\n                    \"\"\n                )\n            ),\n        CommandLineLower =\n            tolower(\n                coalesce(\n                    ProcessCommandLine,\n                    \"\"\n                )\n            ),\n        SearchText =\n            tolower(\n                strcat(\n                    FileName,\n                    \" \",\n                    FolderPath,\n                    \" \",\n                    ProcessCommandLine,\n                    \" \",\n                    ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n                    \" \",\n                    ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName\n                )\n            )\n    | where SearchText has_any(WatchPatterns)\n    | extend\n        EventKey =\n            strcat(\n                tostring(Timestamp),\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(DeviceId),\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(FileName),\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(ProcessCommandLine)\n            )\n    | project\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User =\n            tostring(\n                coalesce(\n                    InitiatingProcessAccountUpn,\n                    InitiatingProcessAccountName\n                )\n            ),\n        FileName,\n        FileNameLower,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n        CommandLineLower,\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// FILENAME MATCHES\n// ============================================================\n\nlet FileNameMatches =\n    CandidateProcesses\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\n    | join kind=inner (\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | where MatchField =~ \"FileName\"\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\n    ) on JoinKey\n    | extend\n        IsMatch =\n            case(\n                MatchType =~ \"Exact\",\n                    FileNameLower == SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Contains\",\n                    FileNameLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                    FileNameLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Prefix\",\n                    FileNameLower startswith SearchPattern,\n\n                false\n            )\n    | where IsMatch\n    | extend\n        MatchedOn = \"FileName\"\n    | project\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User,\n\n        Name,\n        Category,\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n        SourceURL,\n        Vendor,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n\n        MatchedOn,\n        Pattern,\n\n        FileName,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// COMMAND-LINE MATCHES\n// ============================================================\n\nlet CommandLineMatches =\n    CandidateProcesses\n    | where isnotempty(ProcessCommandLine)\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\n    | join kind=inner (\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | where MatchField =~ \"ProcessCommandLine\"\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\n    ) on JoinKey\n    | extend\n        IsMatch =\n            case(\n                MatchType =~ \"Exact\",\n                    CommandLineLower == SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Contains\",\n                    CommandLineLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                    CommandLineLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Prefix\",\n                    CommandLineLower startswith SearchPattern,\n\n                false\n            )\n    | where IsMatch\n    | extend\n        MatchedOn = \"ProcessCommandLine\"\n    | project\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User,\n        Name,\n        Category,\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n        SourceURL,\n        Vendor,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n\n        MatchedOn,\n        Pattern,\n\n        FileName,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// COMBINE AND DEDUPLICATE EVENT MATCHES\n// ============================================================\n\nlet EventMatches =\n    union\n        FileNameMatches,\n        CommandLineMatches\n    | summarize\n        MatchedFields =\n            make_set(\n                MatchedOn,\n                10\n            ),\n\n        MatchedPatterns =\n            make_set(\n                Pattern,\n                50\n            ),\n\n        MatchedSources =\n            make_set(\n                SourceURL,\n                10\n            )\n      by\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User,\n\n        Name,\n        Vendor,\n        Category,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n\n        FileName,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n\n        SHA256;\n\n\n// ============================================================\n// LOCAL SANCTIONED AGENTS NOT OBSERVED\n// ============================================================\nlet LocalObservedAgents =\n    EventMatches\n    | extend AgentKey = replace_regex(tolower(tostring(Name)), \"[^a-z0-9]\", \"\")\n    | summarize by AgentKey;\nAgentWatchlist\n| extend AgentKey = replace_regex(tolower(tostring(Name)), \"[^a-z0-9]\", \"\")\n| where SourceFrom =~ \"Local\"\n| where set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, AgentKey)\n| where AgentKey !in (LocalObservedAgents | project AgentKey)\n| summarize Vendor = take_any(Vendor), Category = take_any(Category), Sources = make_set(SourceURL, 10) by AgentKey, Tool = Name\n| project Tool, Vendor, Category, Sources = strcat_array(Sources, \", \")\n| order by Tool asc",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "⚪ Local Sanctioned Agents Not Observed - {$rowCount}",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{ws}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table",
              "tileSettings": {
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Tool"
                },
                "showBorder": false
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "query - Local Sanctioned Agents Not Observed"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ============================================================\n// CLOUD AI AGENT / TOOL DETECTION\n// ============================================================\n// Reads cloud rows from ai_agent_watchlist.csv.\n// Missing source tables are ignored with union isfuzzy=true.\n// Produces one row per normalized cloud agent.\n// ============================================================\n// ============================================================\n// WATCHLIST\n// ============================================================\nlet AgentWatchlist =\n    externaldata(\n        Name:string,\n        Category:string,\n        MatchField:string,\n        Pattern:string,\n        MatchType:string,\n        RiskLevel:string,\n        DefaultAction:string,\n        Reason:string,\n        SourceURL:string,\n        Vendor:string,\n        SourceFrom:string,\n        TelemetrySource:string\n    )\n    [\n        @\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quorumcyber-workbooks/workbooks/main/Files/QCDataTypes/ai_agent_watchlist.csv\"\n    ]\n    with (\n        format=\"csv\",\n        ignoreFirstRecord=true\n    )\n    | extend\n        SourceFrom =\n            trim(\n                @\"[\\s]+\",\n                tostring(SourceFrom)\n            ),\n        AgentKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(Name)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            ),\n        SearchPattern =\n            tolower(\n                case(\n                    MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                        replace_string(\n                            replace_string(Pattern, \"*\", \"\"),\n                            \"?\",\n                            \"\"\n                        ),\n                    Pattern\n                )\n            )\n    | where tolower(SourceFrom) == \"cloud\"\n    | where isnotempty(AgentKey)\n    | where isnotempty(SearchPattern)\n    | distinct\n        Name,\n        Category,\n        MatchField,\n        Pattern,\n        MatchType,\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n        SourceURL,\n        Vendor,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n        AgentKey,\n        SearchPattern;\n// ============================================================\n// SANCTIONED AI AGENT POLICY KEYS\n// ============================================================\nlet SanctionedAgents =\n    dynamic([{SanctionedAgents}]);\n\nlet SelectedAgentKeys =\n    toscalar(\n        print SelectedValue = SanctionedAgents\n        | mv-expand SelectedValue\n        | extend SelectedKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(SelectedValue)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            )\n        | where isnotempty(SelectedKey)\n        | summarize make_set(SelectedKey, 500)\n    );\n\n// ============================================================\n// OPTIONAL CLOUD TABLES\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudEvents =\n    union isfuzzy=true\n    (\n        // Microsoft 365 and Purview audit activity\n        OfficeActivity\n        | where TimeGenerated between (\n            {TimeRange:start}\n            ..\n            {TimeRange:end}\n        )\n        | extend\n            EventTime = TimeGenerated,\n            RecordId = tostring(OfficeId),\n            Actor = tostring(coalesce(UserId, Actor, Application)),\n            ActorIP = tostring(coalesce(ClientIP, ActorIpAddress, Client_IPAddress)),\n            OperationText = tostring(coalesce(Operation, Activity)),\n            ResourceText = tostring(coalesce(Application, OfficeWorkload, OfficeObjectId, ItemName, TeamName, ChatName)),\n            SearchText =\n                tolower(\n                    strcat(\n                        UserId,\n                        \" \",\n                        Actor,\n                        \" \",\n                        Application,\n                        \" \",\n                        Operation,\n                        \" \",\n                        Activity,\n                        \" \",\n                        OfficeWorkload,\n                        \" \",\n                        AddonName,\n                        \" \",\n                        CustomEvent,\n                        \" \",\n                        Parameters,\n                        \" \",\n                        ModifiedProperties,\n                        \" \",\n                        OfficeObjectId,\n                        \" \",\n                        ItemName,\n                        \" \",\n                        TeamName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ChatName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ChannelName\n                    )\n                ),\n            Evidence =\n                strcat(\n                    \"Operation=\",\n                    Operation,\n                    \"; Activity=\",\n                    Activity,\n                    \"; Application=\",\n                    Application,\n                    \"; OfficeWorkload=\",\n                    OfficeWorkload,\n                    \"; Item=\",\n                    ItemName,\n                    \"; Resource=\",\n                    OfficeObjectId,\n                    \"; Parameters=\",\n                    Parameters\n                )\n        | project\n            ObservedTable = \"OfficeActivity\",\n            EventTime,\n            RecordId,\n            Actor,\n            ActorIP,\n            OperationText,\n            ResourceText,\n            SearchText,\n            Evidence\n    ),\n    (\n        // Microsoft Entra audit activity\n        AuditLogs\n        | where TimeGenerated between (\n            {TimeRange:start}\n            ..\n            {TimeRange:end}\n        )\n        | extend\n            EventTime = TimeGenerated,\n            RecordId = tostring(Id),\n            Actor = tostring(coalesce(InitiatedBy.user.userPrincipalName, InitiatedBy.app.displayName, Identity)),\n            ActorIP = \"\",\n            OperationText = tostring(coalesce(ActivityDisplayName, OperationName)),\n            ResourceText = tostring(ResourceId),\n            SearchText =\n                tolower(\n                    strcat(\n                        ActivityDisplayName,\n                        \" \",\n                        OperationName,\n                        \" \",\n                        Identity,\n                        \" \",\n                        tostring(InitiatedBy),\n                        \" \",\n                        tostring(TargetResources),\n                        \" \",\n                        tostring(AdditionalDetails),\n                        \" \",\n                        LoggedByService,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceProvider,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceId,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResultDescription\n                    )\n                ),\n            Evidence =\n                strcat(\n                    \"Activity=\",\n                    ActivityDisplayName,\n                    \"; Operation=\",\n                    OperationName,\n                    \"; Identity=\",\n                    Identity,\n                    \"; InitiatedBy=\",\n                    tostring(InitiatedBy),\n                    \"; TargetResources=\",\n                    tostring(TargetResources),\n                    \"; Result=\",\n                    ResultType,\n                    \"; Description=\",\n                    ResultDescription\n                )\n        | project\n            ObservedTable = \"AuditLogs\",\n            EventTime,\n            RecordId,\n            Actor,\n            ActorIP,\n            OperationText,\n            ResourceText,\n            SearchText,\n            Evidence\n    ),\n    (\n        // Microsoft Entra service-principal sign-ins\n        AADServicePrincipalSignInLogs\n        | where TimeGenerated between (\n            {TimeRange:start}\n            ..\n            {TimeRange:end}\n        )\n        | extend\n            EventTime = TimeGenerated,\n            RecordId = tostring(Id),\n            Actor = tostring(coalesce(ServicePrincipalName, ServicePrincipalId, AppId, Identity)),\n            ActorIP = tostring(IPAddress),\n            OperationText = tostring(OperationName),\n            ResourceText = tostring(coalesce(ResourceDisplayName, ResourceIdentity, ResourceServicePrincipalId)),\n            SearchText =\n                tolower(\n                    strcat(\n                        ServicePrincipalName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ServicePrincipalId,\n                        \" \",\n                        AppId,\n                        \" \",\n                        Identity,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceDisplayName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceIdentity,\n                        \" \",\n                        Agent,\n                        \" \",\n                        OperationName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResultType,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResultDescription,\n                        \" \",\n                        UserAgent\n                    )\n                ),\n            Evidence =\n                strcat(\n                    \"ServicePrincipal=\",\n                    ServicePrincipalName,\n                    \"; ServicePrincipalId=\",\n                    ServicePrincipalId,\n                    \"; AppId=\",\n                    AppId,\n                    \"; Resource=\",\n                    ResourceDisplayName,\n                    \"; Result=\",\n                    ResultType,\n                    \"; Description=\",\n                    ResultDescription,\n                    \"; UserAgent=\",\n                    UserAgent\n                )\n        | project\n            ObservedTable = \"AADServicePrincipalSignInLogs\",\n            EventTime,\n            RecordId,\n            Actor,\n            ActorIP,\n            OperationText,\n            ResourceText,\n            SearchText,\n            Evidence\n    );\n// ============================================================\n// BUILD CLOUD SEARCH LIST\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudPatterns =\n    toscalar(\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | summarize make_set(SearchPattern, 500)\n    );\n// ============================================================\n// CANDIDATE CLOUD EVENTS\n// ============================================================\nlet CandidateCloudEvents =\n    CloudEvents\n    | where EventTime between (\n        {TimeRange:start}\n        ..\n        {TimeRange:end}\n    )\n    | where isnotempty(SearchText)\n    | where SearchText has_any(CloudPatterns)\n    | extend\n        EventKey =\n            strcat(\n                ObservedTable,\n                \"|\",\n                RecordId,\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(EventTime),\n                \"|\",\n                Actor,\n                \"|\",\n                OperationText\n            );\n// ============================================================\n// MATCH CLOUD WATCHLIST\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudMatches =\n    CandidateCloudEvents\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\n    | join kind=inner (\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\n    ) on JoinKey\n    | where SearchText contains SearchPattern\n    | summarize\n        arg_max(EventTime, *)\n      by\n        EventKey,\n        AgentKey,\n        Vendor,\n        Pattern,\n        SourceFrom;\n\n// ============================================================\n// CLOUD AI AGENT GOVERNANCE AT A GLANCE\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudObservedAgents =\n    CloudMatches\n    | summarize by AgentKey;\nlet CloudConfiguredCount =\n    toscalar(\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | where SourceFrom =~ \"Cloud\"\n        | where set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, AgentKey)\n        | summarize dcount(AgentKey)\n    );\nlet CloudSanctionedObserved =\n    toscalar(\n        CloudObservedAgents\n        | where set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, AgentKey)\n        | summarize dcount(AgentKey)\n    );\nlet CloudUnsanctionedObserved =\n    toscalar(\n        CloudObservedAgents\n        | where set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, AgentKey) == false\n        | summarize dcount(AgentKey)\n    );\nlet CloudSanctionedNotObserved =\n    iff(CloudConfiguredCount > CloudSanctionedObserved, CloudConfiguredCount - CloudSanctionedObserved, 0);\nunion\n    (print SortOrder = 1, Metric = \"🟢 Sanctioned Agents Observed\", Value = tolong(CloudSanctionedObserved), Detail = \"Selected cloud agents with evidence in the period\"),\n    (print SortOrder = 2, Metric = \"🔴 Unsanctioned Agents Observed\", Value = tolong(CloudUnsanctionedObserved), Detail = \"Recognised cloud agents not in the selection\"),\n    (print SortOrder = 3, Metric = \"⚪ Sanctioned Agents Not Observed\", Value = tolong(CloudSanctionedNotObserved), Detail = \"Selected cloud agents with no evidence in the period\")\n| order by SortOrder asc\n| project Metric, Value, Detail",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "☁️ Cloud AI Agent Governance at a Glance",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{ws}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Metric",
                  "formatter": 1
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "none"
                  },
                  "numberFormat": {
                    "unit": 17,
                    "options": {
                      "style": "decimal",
                      "maximumFractionDigits": 0,
                      "maximumSignificantDigits": 3
                    }
                  }
                },
                "showBorder": false
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "query - Cloud Agent Governance at a Glance"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ============================================================\n// CLOUD AI AGENT / TOOL DETECTION\n// ============================================================\n// Reads cloud rows from ai_agent_watchlist.csv.\n// Missing source tables are ignored with union isfuzzy=true.\n// Produces one row per normalized cloud agent.\n// ============================================================\n// ============================================================\n// WATCHLIST\n// ============================================================\nlet AgentWatchlist =\n    externaldata(\n        Name:string,\n        Category:string,\n        MatchField:string,\n        Pattern:string,\n        MatchType:string,\n        RiskLevel:string,\n        DefaultAction:string,\n        Reason:string,\n        SourceURL:string,\n        Vendor:string,\n        SourceFrom:string,\n        TelemetrySource:string\n    )\n    [\n        @\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quorumcyber-workbooks/workbooks/main/Files/QCDataTypes/ai_agent_watchlist.csv\"\n    ]\n    with (\n        format=\"csv\",\n        ignoreFirstRecord=true\n    )\n    | extend\n        SourceFrom =\n            trim(\n                @\"[\\s]+\",\n                tostring(SourceFrom)\n            ),\n        AgentKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(Name)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            ),\n        SearchPattern =\n            tolower(\n                case(\n                    MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                        replace_string(\n                            replace_string(Pattern, \"*\", \"\"),\n                            \"?\",\n                            \"\"\n                        ),\n                    Pattern\n                )\n            )\n    | where tolower(SourceFrom) == \"cloud\"\n    | where isnotempty(AgentKey)\n    | where isnotempty(SearchPattern)\n    | distinct\n        Name,\n        Category,\n        MatchField,\n        Pattern,\n        MatchType,\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n        SourceURL,\n        Vendor,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n        AgentKey,\n        SearchPattern;\n// ============================================================\n// SANCTIONED AI AGENT POLICY KEYS\n// ============================================================\nlet SanctionedAgents =\n    dynamic([{SanctionedAgents}]);\n\nlet SelectedAgentKeys =\n    toscalar(\n        print SelectedValue = SanctionedAgents\n        | mv-expand SelectedValue\n        | extend SelectedKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(SelectedValue)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            )\n        | where isnotempty(SelectedKey)\n        | summarize make_set(SelectedKey, 500)\n    );\n\n// ============================================================\n// OPTIONAL CLOUD TABLES\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudEvents =\n    union isfuzzy=true\n    (\n        // Microsoft 365 and Purview audit activity\n        OfficeActivity\n        | where TimeGenerated between (\n            {TimeRange:start}\n            ..\n            {TimeRange:end}\n        )\n        | extend\n            EventTime = TimeGenerated,\n            RecordId = tostring(OfficeId),\n            Actor = tostring(coalesce(UserId, Actor, Application)),\n            ActorIP = tostring(coalesce(ClientIP, ActorIpAddress, Client_IPAddress)),\n            OperationText = tostring(coalesce(Operation, Activity)),\n            ResourceText = tostring(coalesce(Application, OfficeWorkload, OfficeObjectId, ItemName, TeamName, ChatName)),\n            SearchText =\n                tolower(\n                    strcat(\n                        UserId,\n                        \" \",\n                        Actor,\n                        \" \",\n                        Application,\n                        \" \",\n                        Operation,\n                        \" \",\n                        Activity,\n                        \" \",\n                        OfficeWorkload,\n                        \" \",\n                        AddonName,\n                        \" \",\n                        CustomEvent,\n                        \" \",\n                        Parameters,\n                        \" \",\n                        ModifiedProperties,\n                        \" \",\n                        OfficeObjectId,\n                        \" \",\n                        ItemName,\n                        \" \",\n                        TeamName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ChatName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ChannelName\n                    )\n                ),\n            Evidence =\n                strcat(\n                    \"Operation=\",\n                    Operation,\n                    \"; Activity=\",\n                    Activity,\n                    \"; Application=\",\n                    Application,\n                    \"; OfficeWorkload=\",\n                    OfficeWorkload,\n                    \"; Item=\",\n                    ItemName,\n                    \"; Resource=\",\n                    OfficeObjectId,\n                    \"; Parameters=\",\n                    Parameters\n                )\n        | project\n            ObservedTable = \"OfficeActivity\",\n            EventTime,\n            RecordId,\n            Actor,\n            ActorIP,\n            OperationText,\n            ResourceText,\n            SearchText,\n            Evidence\n    ),\n    (\n        // Microsoft Entra audit activity\n        AuditLogs\n        | where TimeGenerated between (\n            {TimeRange:start}\n            ..\n            {TimeRange:end}\n        )\n        | extend\n            EventTime = TimeGenerated,\n            RecordId = tostring(Id),\n            Actor = tostring(coalesce(InitiatedBy.user.userPrincipalName, InitiatedBy.app.displayName, Identity)),\n            ActorIP = \"\",\n            OperationText = tostring(coalesce(ActivityDisplayName, OperationName)),\n            ResourceText = tostring(ResourceId),\n            SearchText =\n                tolower(\n                    strcat(\n                        ActivityDisplayName,\n                        \" \",\n                        OperationName,\n                        \" \",\n                        Identity,\n                        \" \",\n                        tostring(InitiatedBy),\n                        \" \",\n                        tostring(TargetResources),\n                        \" \",\n                        tostring(AdditionalDetails),\n                        \" \",\n                        LoggedByService,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceProvider,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceId,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResultDescription\n                    )\n                ),\n            Evidence =\n                strcat(\n                    \"Activity=\",\n                    ActivityDisplayName,\n                    \"; Operation=\",\n                    OperationName,\n                    \"; Identity=\",\n                    Identity,\n                    \"; InitiatedBy=\",\n                    tostring(InitiatedBy),\n                    \"; TargetResources=\",\n                    tostring(TargetResources),\n                    \"; Result=\",\n                    ResultType,\n                    \"; Description=\",\n                    ResultDescription\n                )\n        | project\n            ObservedTable = \"AuditLogs\",\n            EventTime,\n            RecordId,\n            Actor,\n            ActorIP,\n            OperationText,\n            ResourceText,\n            SearchText,\n            Evidence\n    ),\n    (\n        // Microsoft Entra service-principal sign-ins\n        AADServicePrincipalSignInLogs\n        | where TimeGenerated between (\n            {TimeRange:start}\n            ..\n            {TimeRange:end}\n        )\n        | extend\n            EventTime = TimeGenerated,\n            RecordId = tostring(Id),\n            Actor = tostring(coalesce(ServicePrincipalName, ServicePrincipalId, AppId, Identity)),\n            ActorIP = tostring(IPAddress),\n            OperationText = tostring(OperationName),\n            ResourceText = tostring(coalesce(ResourceDisplayName, ResourceIdentity, ResourceServicePrincipalId)),\n            SearchText =\n                tolower(\n                    strcat(\n                        ServicePrincipalName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ServicePrincipalId,\n                        \" \",\n                        AppId,\n                        \" \",\n                        Identity,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceDisplayName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceIdentity,\n                        \" \",\n                        Agent,\n                        \" \",\n                        OperationName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResultType,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResultDescription,\n                        \" \",\n                        UserAgent\n                    )\n                ),\n            Evidence =\n                strcat(\n                    \"ServicePrincipal=\",\n                    ServicePrincipalName,\n                    \"; ServicePrincipalId=\",\n                    ServicePrincipalId,\n                    \"; AppId=\",\n                    AppId,\n                    \"; Resource=\",\n                    ResourceDisplayName,\n                    \"; Result=\",\n                    ResultType,\n                    \"; Description=\",\n                    ResultDescription,\n                    \"; UserAgent=\",\n                    UserAgent\n                )\n        | project\n            ObservedTable = \"AADServicePrincipalSignInLogs\",\n            EventTime,\n            RecordId,\n            Actor,\n            ActorIP,\n            OperationText,\n            ResourceText,\n            SearchText,\n            Evidence\n    );\n// ============================================================\n// BUILD CLOUD SEARCH LIST\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudPatterns =\n    toscalar(\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | summarize make_set(SearchPattern, 500)\n    );\n// ============================================================\n// CANDIDATE CLOUD EVENTS\n// ============================================================\nlet CandidateCloudEvents =\n    CloudEvents\n    | where EventTime between (\n        {TimeRange:start}\n        ..\n        {TimeRange:end}\n    )\n    | where isnotempty(SearchText)\n    | where SearchText has_any(CloudPatterns)\n    | extend\n        EventKey =\n            strcat(\n                ObservedTable,\n                \"|\",\n                RecordId,\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(EventTime),\n                \"|\",\n                Actor,\n                \"|\",\n                OperationText\n            );\n// ============================================================\n// MATCH CLOUD WATCHLIST\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudMatches =\n    CandidateCloudEvents\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\n    | join kind=inner (\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\n    ) on JoinKey\n    | where SearchText contains SearchPattern\n    | summarize\n        arg_max(EventTime, *)\n      by\n        EventKey,\n        AgentKey,\n        Vendor,\n        Pattern,\n        SourceFrom;\n\n// ============================================================\n// CLOUD SANCTIONED AGENTS NOT OBSERVED\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudObservedAgents =\n    CloudMatches\n    | summarize by AgentKey;\nAgentWatchlist\n| where SourceFrom =~ \"Cloud\"\n| where set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, AgentKey)\n| where AgentKey !in (CloudObservedAgents | project AgentKey)\n| summarize Vendor = take_any(Vendor), Category = take_any(Category), Sources = make_set(SourceURL, 10) by AgentKey, Tool = Name\n| project Tool, Vendor, Category, Sources = strcat_array(Sources, \", \")\n| order by Tool asc",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "⚪ Cloud Sanctioned Agents Not Observed - {$rowCount}",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{ws}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table",
              "tileSettings": {
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Tool"
                },
                "showBorder": false
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "query - Cloud Sanctioned Agents Not Observed"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ============================================================\n// AI AGENT / TOOL DETECTION\n//\n// Reads ai_agent_watchlist.csv.\n// Matches LOCAL agents and runtimes against DeviceProcessEvents.\n//\n// Cloud rows are excluded because cloud agents require separate\n// telemetry such as OfficeActivity, Security Copilot, Entra,\n// Purview, or vendor APIs.\n// ============================================================\n\n// ============================================================\n// AI AGENT WATCHLIST\n// ============================================================\n\nlet AgentWatchlist =\n    externaldata(\n        Name:string,\n        Category:string,\n        MatchField:string,\n        Pattern:string,\n        MatchType:string,\n        RiskLevel:string,\n        DefaultAction:string,\n        Reason:string,\n        SourceURL:string,\n        Vendor:string,\n        SourceFrom:string,\n        TelemetrySource:string\n    )\n    [\n        @\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quorumcyber-workbooks/workbooks/main/Files/QCDataTypes/ai_agent_watchlist.csv\"\n    ]\n    with (\n        format=\"csv\",\n        ignoreFirstRecord=true\n    )\n    | extend\n        SearchPattern =\n            tolower(\n                case(\n                    MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                        replace_string(\n                            replace_string(Pattern, \"*\", \"\"),\n                            \"?\",\n                            \"\"\n                        ),\n                    Pattern\n                )\n            )\n    | where SourceFrom =~ \"Local\"\n    | where MatchField in~ (\n        \"FileName\",\n        \"ProcessCommandLine\"\n    )\n    | where TelemetrySource contains \"DeviceProcessEvents\"\n    | where isnotempty(SearchPattern);\n\n// ============================================================\n// SANCTIONED AI AGENT POLICY KEYS\n// ============================================================\nlet SanctionedAgents =\n    dynamic([{SanctionedAgents}]);\n\nlet SelectedAgentKeys =\n    toscalar(\n        print SelectedValue = SanctionedAgents\n        | mv-expand SelectedValue\n        | extend SelectedKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(SelectedValue)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            )\n        | where isnotempty(SelectedKey)\n        | summarize make_set(SelectedKey, 500)\n    );\n\n// ============================================================\n// BUILD SEARCH LIST\n// ============================================================\n\nlet WatchPatterns =\n    toscalar(\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | summarize make_set(SearchPattern, 500)\n    );\n\n// ============================================================\n// CANDIDATE PROCESS EVENTS\n// ============================================================\nlet CandidateProcesses =\n    DeviceProcessEvents\n    | where Timestamp between (\n        {TimeRange:start}\n        ..\n        {TimeRange:end}\n    )\n    | where isnotempty(DeviceName)\n    | extend\n        FileNameLower =\n            tolower(\n                coalesce(\n                    FileName,\n                    \"\"\n                )\n            ),\n        CommandLineLower =\n            tolower(\n                coalesce(\n                    ProcessCommandLine,\n                    \"\"\n                )\n            ),\n        SearchText =\n            tolower(\n                strcat(\n                    FileName,\n                    \" \",\n                    FolderPath,\n                    \" \",\n                    ProcessCommandLine,\n                    \" \",\n                    ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n                    \" \",\n                    ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName\n                )\n            )\n    | where SearchText has_any(WatchPatterns)\n    | extend\n        EventKey =\n            strcat(\n                tostring(Timestamp),\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(DeviceId),\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(FileName),\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(ProcessCommandLine)\n            )\n    | project\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User =\n            tostring(\n                coalesce(\n                    InitiatingProcessAccountUpn,\n                    InitiatingProcessAccountName\n                )\n            ),\n        FileName,\n        FileNameLower,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n        CommandLineLower,\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// FILENAME MATCHES\n// ============================================================\n\nlet FileNameMatches =\n    CandidateProcesses\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\n    | join kind=inner (\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | where MatchField =~ \"FileName\"\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\n    ) on JoinKey\n    | extend\n        IsMatch =\n            case(\n                MatchType =~ \"Exact\",\n                    FileNameLower == SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Contains\",\n                    FileNameLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                    FileNameLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Prefix\",\n                    FileNameLower startswith SearchPattern,\n\n                false\n            )\n    | where IsMatch\n    | extend\n        MatchedOn = \"FileName\"\n    | project\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User,\n\n        Name,\n        Category,\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n        SourceURL,\n        Vendor,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n\n        MatchedOn,\n        Pattern,\n\n        FileName,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// COMMAND-LINE MATCHES\n// ============================================================\n\nlet CommandLineMatches =\n    CandidateProcesses\n    | where isnotempty(ProcessCommandLine)\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\n    | join kind=inner (\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | where MatchField =~ \"ProcessCommandLine\"\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\n    ) on JoinKey\n    | extend\n        IsMatch =\n            case(\n                MatchType =~ \"Exact\",\n                    CommandLineLower == SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Contains\",\n                    CommandLineLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                    CommandLineLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Prefix\",\n                    CommandLineLower startswith SearchPattern,\n\n                false\n            )\n    | where IsMatch\n    | extend\n        MatchedOn = \"ProcessCommandLine\"\n    | project\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User,\n        Name,\n        Category,\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n        SourceURL,\n        Vendor,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n\n        MatchedOn,\n        Pattern,\n\n        FileName,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// COMBINE AND DEDUPLICATE EVENT MATCHES\n// ============================================================\n\nlet EventMatches =\n    union\n        FileNameMatches,\n        CommandLineMatches\n    | summarize\n        MatchedFields =\n            make_set(\n                MatchedOn,\n                10\n            ),\n\n        MatchedPatterns =\n            make_set(\n                Pattern,\n                50\n            ),\n\n        MatchedSources =\n            make_set(\n                SourceURL,\n                10\n            )\n      by\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User,\n\n        Name,\n        Vendor,\n        Category,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n\n        FileName,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// SUMMARISE BY TOOL\n// ============================================================\nEventMatches\n| extend\n    ToolKey =\n        strcat_array(\n            extract_all(\n                \"([A-Za-z0-9]+)\",\n                tostring(Name)\n            ),\n            \"\"\n        )\n| summarize\n    ToolName = take_any(Name),\n    ToolVendor = take_any(Vendor),\n    ToolFrom = take_any(SourceFrom),\n    ToolTelemetrySource = take_any(TelemetrySource),\n    ToolCategory = take_any(Category),\n    ToolRiskLevel = take_any(RiskLevel),\n    ToolDefaultAction = take_any(DefaultAction),\n    ToolReason = take_any(Reason),\n    FirstSeen = min(Timestamp),\n    LastSeen = max(Timestamp),\n    Events = dcount(EventKey),\n    Users =\n        dcountif(\n            User,\n            isnotempty(User)\n        ),\n    Devices = dcount(DeviceId),\n    UserList =\n        make_set_if(\n            User,\n            isnotempty(User),\n            30\n        ),\n    DeviceList =\n        make_set_if(\n            DeviceName,\n            isnotempty(DeviceName),\n            30\n        ),\n    MatchFields =\n        make_set(\n            strcat_array(MatchedFields, \", \"),\n            10\n        ),\n    Patterns =\n        make_set(\n            strcat_array(MatchedPatterns, \", \"),\n            50\n        ),\n    Sources =\n        make_set(\n            strcat_array(MatchedSources, \", \"),\n            10\n        ),\n    ExampleProcess =\n        take_any(FileName),\n    ExampleCommandLine =\n        take_any(ProcessCommandLine),\n    ExampleProduct =\n        take_any(ProcessVersionInfoProductName),\n    ExampleCompany =\n        take_any(ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName),\n    ExamplePath =\n        take_any(FolderPath),\n    ExampleSHA256 =\n        take_any(SHA256)\n  by\n    ToolKey\n| extend\n    IsSanctioned =\n        array_length(SelectedAgentKeys) > 0\n        and set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, tolower(ToolKey))\n| extend\n    Governance =\n        iff(\n            IsSanctioned,\n            \"🟢 Sanctioned\",\n            \"🔴 Unsanctioned\"\n        ),\n    Risk =\n        case(\n            ToolRiskLevel =~ \"High\",\n                \"🔴 High\",\n            ToolRiskLevel =~ \"Medium\",\n                \"🟠 Medium\",\n            ToolRiskLevel =~ \"Low\",\n                \"🟡 Low\",\n            strcat(\"⚪ \", tostring(ToolRiskLevel))\n        ),\n    RiskOrder =\n        case(\n            ToolRiskLevel =~ \"High\",\n                1,\n            ToolRiskLevel =~ \"Medium\",\n                2,\n            ToolRiskLevel =~ \"Low\",\n                3,\n            4\n        )\n| project\n    Tool = ToolName,\n    Vendor = ToolVendor,\n    ['From'] = ToolFrom,\n    ['Telemetry Source'] = ToolTelemetrySource,\n    ['Policy Mapping'] =\n        iff(\n            IsSanctioned,\n            \"Sanctioned\",\n            \"Unsanctioned\"\n        ),\n    Governance,\n    Risk,\n    Category = ToolCategory,\n    Users,\n    Devices,\n    ['User List'] = UserList,\n    ['Device List'] = DeviceList,\n    Match =\n        strcat_array(\n            array_sort_asc(MatchFields),\n            \", \"\n        ),\n    Pattern =\n        strcat_array(\n            array_sort_asc(Patterns),\n            \", \"\n        ),\n    Sources,\n    Process = ExampleProcess,\n    CommandLine = ExampleCommandLine,\n    Product = ExampleProduct,\n    Company = ExampleCompany,\n    Events,\n    ['First Seen'] = FirstSeen,\n    ['Last Seen'] = LastSeen,\n    DefaultAction = ToolDefaultAction,\n    Reason = ToolReason,\n    ExamplePath,\n    ExampleSHA256,\n    RiskOrder\n| order by\n    RiskOrder asc,\n    Users desc,\n    Events desc,\n    ['Last Seen'] desc\n| project-away RiskOrder",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "🤖 [Local] AI Agent / Tool Detection, count: {$rowCount}",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{ws}"
              ],
              "gridSettings": {
                "filter": true
              }
            },
            "name": "query - 4"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ============================================================\n// CLOUD AI AGENT / TOOL DETECTION\n// ============================================================\n// Reads cloud rows from ai_agent_watchlist.csv.\n// Missing source tables are ignored with union isfuzzy=true.\n// Produces one row per normalized cloud agent.\n// ============================================================\n// ============================================================\n// WATCHLIST\n// ============================================================\nlet AgentWatchlist =\n    externaldata(\n        Name:string,\n        Category:string,\n        MatchField:string,\n        Pattern:string,\n        MatchType:string,\n        RiskLevel:string,\n        DefaultAction:string,\n        Reason:string,\n        SourceURL:string,\n        Vendor:string,\n        SourceFrom:string,\n        TelemetrySource:string\n    )\n    [\n        @\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quorumcyber-workbooks/workbooks/main/Files/QCDataTypes/ai_agent_watchlist.csv\"\n    ]\n    with (\n        format=\"csv\",\n        ignoreFirstRecord=true\n    )\n    | extend\n        SourceFrom =\n            trim(\n                @\"[\\s]+\",\n                tostring(SourceFrom)\n            ),\n        AgentKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(Name)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            ),\n        SearchPattern =\n            tolower(\n                case(\n                    MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                        replace_string(\n                            replace_string(Pattern, \"*\", \"\"),\n                            \"?\",\n                            \"\"\n                        ),\n                    Pattern\n                )\n            )\n    | where tolower(SourceFrom) == \"cloud\"\n    | where isnotempty(AgentKey)\n    | where isnotempty(SearchPattern)\n    | distinct\n        Name,\n        Category,\n        MatchField,\n        Pattern,\n        MatchType,\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n        SourceURL,\n        Vendor,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n        AgentKey,\n        SearchPattern;\n// ============================================================\n// SANCTIONED AI AGENT POLICY KEYS\n// ============================================================\nlet SanctionedAgents =\n    dynamic([{SanctionedAgents}]);\n\nlet SelectedAgentKeys =\n    toscalar(\n        print SelectedValue = SanctionedAgents\n        | mv-expand SelectedValue\n        | extend SelectedKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(SelectedValue)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            )\n        | where isnotempty(SelectedKey)\n        | summarize make_set(SelectedKey, 500)\n    );\n\n// ============================================================\n// OPTIONAL CLOUD TABLES\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudEvents =\n    union isfuzzy=true\n    (\n        // Microsoft 365 and Purview audit activity\n        OfficeActivity\n        | where TimeGenerated between (\n            {TimeRange:start}\n            ..\n            {TimeRange:end}\n        )\n        | extend\n            EventTime = TimeGenerated,\n            RecordId = tostring(OfficeId),\n            Actor = tostring(coalesce(UserId, Actor, Application)),\n            ActorIP = tostring(coalesce(ClientIP, ActorIpAddress, Client_IPAddress)),\n            OperationText = tostring(coalesce(Operation, Activity)),\n            ResourceText = tostring(coalesce(Application, OfficeWorkload, OfficeObjectId, ItemName, TeamName, ChatName)),\n            SearchText =\n                tolower(\n                    strcat(\n                        UserId,\n                        \" \",\n                        Actor,\n                        \" \",\n                        Application,\n                        \" \",\n                        Operation,\n                        \" \",\n                        Activity,\n                        \" \",\n                        OfficeWorkload,\n                        \" \",\n                        AddonName,\n                        \" \",\n                        CustomEvent,\n                        \" \",\n                        Parameters,\n                        \" \",\n                        ModifiedProperties,\n                        \" \",\n                        OfficeObjectId,\n                        \" \",\n                        ItemName,\n                        \" \",\n                        TeamName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ChatName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ChannelName\n                    )\n                ),\n            Evidence =\n                strcat(\n                    \"Operation=\",\n                    Operation,\n                    \"; Activity=\",\n                    Activity,\n                    \"; Application=\",\n                    Application,\n                    \"; OfficeWorkload=\",\n                    OfficeWorkload,\n                    \"; Item=\",\n                    ItemName,\n                    \"; Resource=\",\n                    OfficeObjectId,\n                    \"; Parameters=\",\n                    Parameters\n                )\n        | project\n            ObservedTable = \"OfficeActivity\",\n            EventTime,\n            RecordId,\n            Actor,\n            ActorIP,\n            OperationText,\n            ResourceText,\n            SearchText,\n            Evidence\n    ),\n    (\n        // Microsoft Entra audit activity\n        AuditLogs\n        | where TimeGenerated between (\n            {TimeRange:start}\n            ..\n            {TimeRange:end}\n        )\n        | extend\n            EventTime = TimeGenerated,\n            RecordId = tostring(Id),\n            Actor = tostring(coalesce(InitiatedBy.user.userPrincipalName, InitiatedBy.app.displayName, Identity)),\n            ActorIP = \"\",\n            OperationText = tostring(coalesce(ActivityDisplayName, OperationName)),\n            ResourceText = tostring(ResourceId),\n            SearchText =\n                tolower(\n                    strcat(\n                        ActivityDisplayName,\n                        \" \",\n                        OperationName,\n                        \" \",\n                        Identity,\n                        \" \",\n                        tostring(InitiatedBy),\n                        \" \",\n                        tostring(TargetResources),\n                        \" \",\n                        tostring(AdditionalDetails),\n                        \" \",\n                        LoggedByService,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceProvider,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceId,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResultDescription\n                    )\n                ),\n            Evidence =\n                strcat(\n                    \"Activity=\",\n                    ActivityDisplayName,\n                    \"; Operation=\",\n                    OperationName,\n                    \"; Identity=\",\n                    Identity,\n                    \"; InitiatedBy=\",\n                    tostring(InitiatedBy),\n                    \"; TargetResources=\",\n                    tostring(TargetResources),\n                    \"; Result=\",\n                    ResultType,\n                    \"; Description=\",\n                    ResultDescription\n                )\n        | project\n            ObservedTable = \"AuditLogs\",\n            EventTime,\n            RecordId,\n            Actor,\n            ActorIP,\n            OperationText,\n            ResourceText,\n            SearchText,\n            Evidence\n    ),\n    (\n        // Microsoft Entra service-principal sign-ins\n        AADServicePrincipalSignInLogs\n        | where TimeGenerated between (\n            {TimeRange:start}\n            ..\n            {TimeRange:end}\n        )\n        | extend\n            EventTime = TimeGenerated,\n            RecordId = tostring(Id),\n            Actor = tostring(coalesce(ServicePrincipalName, ServicePrincipalId, AppId, Identity)),\n            ActorIP = tostring(IPAddress),\n            OperationText = tostring(OperationName),\n            ResourceText = tostring(coalesce(ResourceDisplayName, ResourceIdentity, ResourceServicePrincipalId)),\n            SearchText =\n                tolower(\n                    strcat(\n                        ServicePrincipalName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ServicePrincipalId,\n                        \" \",\n                        AppId,\n                        \" \",\n                        Identity,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceDisplayName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceIdentity,\n                        \" \",\n                        Agent,\n                        \" \",\n                        OperationName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResultType,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResultDescription,\n                        \" \",\n                        UserAgent\n                    )\n                ),\n            Evidence =\n                strcat(\n                    \"ServicePrincipal=\",\n                    ServicePrincipalName,\n                    \"; ServicePrincipalId=\",\n                    ServicePrincipalId,\n                    \"; AppId=\",\n                    AppId,\n                    \"; Resource=\",\n                    ResourceDisplayName,\n                    \"; Result=\",\n                    ResultType,\n                    \"; Description=\",\n                    ResultDescription,\n                    \"; UserAgent=\",\n                    UserAgent\n                )\n        | project\n            ObservedTable = \"AADServicePrincipalSignInLogs\",\n            EventTime,\n            RecordId,\n            Actor,\n            ActorIP,\n            OperationText,\n            ResourceText,\n            SearchText,\n            Evidence\n    );\n// ============================================================\n// BUILD CLOUD SEARCH LIST\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudPatterns =\n    toscalar(\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | summarize make_set(SearchPattern, 500)\n    );\n// ============================================================\n// CANDIDATE CLOUD EVENTS\n// ============================================================\nlet CandidateCloudEvents =\n    CloudEvents\n    | where EventTime between (\n        {TimeRange:start}\n        ..\n        {TimeRange:end}\n    )\n    | where isnotempty(SearchText)\n    | where SearchText has_any(CloudPatterns)\n    | extend\n        EventKey =\n            strcat(\n                ObservedTable,\n                \"|\",\n                RecordId,\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(EventTime),\n                \"|\",\n                Actor,\n                \"|\",\n                OperationText\n            );\n// ============================================================\n// MATCH CLOUD WATCHLIST\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudMatches =\n    CandidateCloudEvents\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\n    | join kind=inner (\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\n    ) on JoinKey\n    | where SearchText contains SearchPattern\n    | summarize\n        arg_max(EventTime, *)\n      by\n        EventKey,\n        AgentKey,\n        Vendor,\n        Pattern,\n        SourceFrom;\n// ============================================================\n// SUMMARISE BY NORMALIZED CLOUD AGENT\n// ============================================================\nCloudMatches\n| summarize\n    AgentName = take_any(Name),\n    AgentVendor = take_any(Vendor),\n    AgentCategory = take_any(Category),\n    AgentFrom = take_any(SourceFrom),\n    AgentTelemetrySource = take_any(TelemetrySource),\n    AgentRiskLevel = take_any(RiskLevel),\n    AgentDefaultAction = take_any(DefaultAction),\n    AgentReason = take_any(Reason),\n    FirstSeen = min(EventTime),\n    LastSeen = max(EventTime),\n    Events = dcount(EventKey),\n    Users = dcount(Actor),\n    TableCount = dcount(ObservedTable),\n    UserList = make_set_if(Actor, isnotempty(Actor), 30),\n    IPList = make_set_if(ActorIP, isnotempty(ActorIP), 30),\n    ObservedTableList = make_set(ObservedTable, 20),\n    Operations = make_set(OperationText, 30),\n    Resources = make_set(ResourceText, 30),\n    Patterns = make_set(Pattern, 50),\n    Sources = make_set(SourceURL, 10),\n    ExampleActor = take_any(Actor),\n    ExampleOperation = take_any(OperationText),\n    ExampleResource = take_any(ResourceText),\n    ExampleEvidence = take_any(Evidence)\n  by\n    AgentKey\n// ============================================================\n// DISPLAY RISK AND OUTPUT\n// ============================================================\n| extend\n    IsSanctioned =\n        array_length(SelectedAgentKeys) > 0\n        and set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, tolower(AgentKey))\n| extend\n    Governance =\n        iff(\n            IsSanctioned,\n            \"🟢 Sanctioned\",\n            \"🔴 Unsanctioned\"\n        ),\n    Risk =\n        case(\n            AgentRiskLevel =~ \"High\",\n                \"🔴 High\",\n            AgentRiskLevel =~ \"Medium\",\n                \"🟠 Medium\",\n            AgentRiskLevel =~ \"Low\",\n                \"🟡 Low\",\n            strcat(\"⚪ \", tostring(AgentRiskLevel))\n        ),\n    RiskOrder =\n        case(\n            AgentRiskLevel =~ \"High\",\n                1,\n            AgentRiskLevel =~ \"Medium\",\n                2,\n            AgentRiskLevel =~ \"Low\",\n                3,\n            4\n        ),\n    ObservedTables =\n        strcat_array(\n            ObservedTableList,\n            \", \"\n        ),\n    PatternList =\n        strcat_array(\n            Patterns,\n            \", \"\n        )\n| project\n    Tool = AgentName,\n    Vendor = AgentVendor,\n    ['From'] = AgentFrom,\n    ['Telemetry Source'] = AgentTelemetrySource,\n    ['Observed Tables'] = ObservedTables,\n    ['Policy Mapping'] =\n        iff(\n            IsSanctioned,\n            \"Sanctioned\",\n            \"Unsanctioned\"\n        ),\n    Governance,\n    Risk,\n    Category = AgentCategory,\n    Users,\n    Tables = TableCount,\n    ['User List'] = UserList,\n    ['IP List'] = IPList,\n    Operations,\n    Resources,\n    Pattern = PatternList,\n    Sources,\n    Actor = ExampleActor,\n    Operation = ExampleOperation,\n    Resource = ExampleResource,\n    Events,\n    ['First Seen'] = FirstSeen,\n    ['Last Seen'] = LastSeen,\n    DefaultAction = AgentDefaultAction,\n    Reason = AgentReason,\n    Evidence = ExampleEvidence,\n    RiskOrder\n| order by\n    RiskOrder asc,\n    Users desc,\n    Events desc,\n    ['Last Seen'] desc\n| project-away RiskOrder",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "☁️ [Cloud] AI Agent / Tool Detection, count: {$rowCount}",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{ws}"
              ],
              "gridSettings": {
                "filter": true
              },
              "sortBy": []
            },
            "name": "query - 3"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "\n## 🤖 Understanding the AI Agent Detection Results\n\nThese reports compare observed activity against the maintained AI agent detection catalogue and the selected sanctioned-agent policy.\n\nThe **Local** report uses endpoint process telemetry to identify local agents, model hosts, and agent tooling through process names and command lines. The **Cloud** report uses available audit and identity telemetry, including Microsoft 365, Entra, Purview, Defender, and service-principal activity.\n\nResults are grouped into one row per detected agent. Each row includes the affected users, devices or tables, observed operations, evidence, first and last seen times, risk level, and recommended default action.\n\nRisk and action values come from the detection catalogue and support investigation. They do not determine whether an agent is sanctioned or unsanctioned; that classification comes from the selected sanctioned-agent policies.\n\n### Catalogue and Governance Watchlist\n\nThe public `ai_agent_watchlist.csv` catalogue is used to match local and cloud AI agents and tools.\n\nThe optional local governance file `ai_agent_governance_watchlist.csv` is uploaded to Sentinel as the **AIAgentGovernance** watchlist. It contains customer-specific governance entries and sanctioned selections, using the `Key` column as the Sentinel SearchKey. It does not replace the public detection catalogue.\n\n### Log Sources\n\n- **DeviceProcessEvents** — Local agent, model-host, process-name, and command-line activity.\n- **OfficeActivity** — Microsoft 365 and Purview audit activity.\n- **AuditLogs** — Microsoft Entra audit activity.\n- **AADServicePrincipalSignInLogs** — Microsoft Entra service-principal sign-in activity.\n\nCloud sources are queried opportunistically; unavailable tables are ignored."
            },
            "name": "text - AI Agent Tool Summary"
          }
        ]
      },
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "selectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "agents"
      },
      "name": "group - agents"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "title": "Agents",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 9,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
              "parameters": [
                {
                  "id": "4633b245-f9a0-462d-87eb-1334f18e8202",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "SanctionedAgents",
                  "label": "🌱 Sanctioned AI Agents",
                  "type": 2,
                  "description": "Approved AI agent and tool identities. Select public catalogue entries or use the separate AIAgentGovernance watchlist rows marked Sanctioned=TRUE for automatic selection.",
                  "isGlobal": true,
                  "multiSelect": true,
                  "quote": "'",
                  "delimiter": ",",
                  "query": "let PublicAgentData =\r\n    externaldata(\r\n        Name:string,\r\n        Category:string,\r\n        MatchField:string,\r\n        Pattern:string,\r\n        MatchType:string,\r\n        RiskLevel:string,\r\n        DefaultAction:string,\r\n        Reason:string,\r\n        SourceURL:string,\r\n        Vendor:string,\r\n        SourceFrom:string,\r\n        TelemetrySource:string\r\n    )\r\n    [\r\n        @\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quorumcyber-workbooks/workbooks/main/Files/QCDataTypes/ai_agent_watchlist.csv\"\r\n    ]\r\n    with (\r\n        format=\"csv\",\r\n        ignoreFirstRecord=true\r\n    )\r\n    | extend\r\n        AgentName = tostring(Name),\r\n        AgentKey = replace_regex(tolower(tostring(Name)), \"[^a-z0-9]\", \"\"),\r\n        Vendor = tostring(Vendor),\r\n        Category = tostring(Category),\r\n        Sanctioned = false,\r\n        CatalogueSource = \"Public\",\r\n        SourcePriority = 1\r\n    | where isnotempty(AgentKey)\r\n    | project\r\n        AgentName,\r\n        AgentKey,\r\n        Vendor,\r\n        Category,\r\n        Sanctioned,\r\n        CatalogueSource,\r\n        SourcePriority;\r\n\r\nlet LocalAgentData =\r\n    union isfuzzy=true\r\n    (\r\n        Watchlist\r\n        | where WatchlistAlias == \"AIAgentGovernance\"\r\n        | summarize arg_max(LastUpdatedTimeUTC, *) by SearchKey\r\n        | where isnotempty(WatchlistItem)\r\n        | extend W = todynamic(WatchlistItem)\r\n        | extend\r\n            AgentName = tostring(coalesce(W.AgentName, W.Name, W.Product)),\r\n            AgentPolicyKey = tostring(coalesce(W.PolicyKey, W.Key, SearchKey)),\r\n            Vendor = tostring(coalesce(W.Vendor, W.Provider)),\r\n            Category = tostring(W.Category),\r\n            Sanctioned = tobool(W.Sanctioned)\r\n        | extend\r\n            AgentKey = replace_regex(tolower(AgentPolicyKey), \"[^a-z0-9]\", \"\"),\r\n            CatalogueSource = \"Local Watchlist\",\r\n            SourcePriority = 2\r\n        | where isnotempty(AgentKey)\r\n        | project\r\n            AgentName,\r\n            AgentKey,\r\n            Vendor,\r\n            Category,\r\n            Sanctioned,\r\n            CatalogueSource,\r\n            SourcePriority\r\n    );\r\n\r\nlet LocalAgentKeys =\r\n    LocalAgentData\r\n    | distinct AgentKey\r\n    | extend HasLocal = true;\r\n\r\nlet AgentData =\r\n    union\r\n        PublicAgentData,\r\n        LocalAgentData\r\n    | summarize arg_max(SourcePriority, *) by AgentKey;\r\n\r\nAgentData\r\n| join kind=leftouter LocalAgentKeys on AgentKey\r\n| extend\r\n    HasLocal = coalesce(HasLocal, false),\r\n    IsSelected = HasLocal and Sanctioned == true\r\n| extend\r\n    Label =\r\n        strcat(\r\n            AgentName,\r\n            iff(isnotempty(Vendor), strcat(\" - \", Vendor), \"\"),\r\n            iff(HasLocal, \" [Local]\", \"\")\r\n        )\r\n| project\r\n    Value = AgentKey,\r\n    Label,\r\n    selected = IsSelected\r\n| order by Label asc",
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [],
                    "showDefault": false
                  },
                  "timeContext": {
                    "durationMs": 86400000
                  },
                  "queryType": 0,
                  "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
                },
                {
                  "id": "f4a0292d-9ca2-4c73-bd4f-ebcae9a26e91",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "SanctionedAgentsCount",
                  "type": 1,
                  "isRequired": true,
                  "query": "resources\r\n| take 1\r\n| project SanctionedAgentsCount =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(\"{SanctionedAgents}\"),\r\n        0,\r\n        array_length(split(\"{SanctionedAgents}\", \",\"))\r\n    )",
                  "crossComponentResources": [
                    "{ws}"
                  ],
                  "timeContext": {
                    "durationMs": 0
                  },
                  "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
                  "queryType": 1,
                  "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
                }
              ],
              "style": "pills",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
            },
            "name": "parameters - AI Agent sanctions"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "> ### 🤖 Configure Sanctioned AI Agents\n>\n> **Select the AI agents and tools approved for use within your organisation.** If a Sentinel watchlist with alias **AIAgentGovernance** is present, local entries are merged with the public catalogue and rows marked `Sanctioned=TRUE` are selected automatically. Local catalogue entries are shown with **[Local]**.\n>\n> 🟢 **Sanctioned** — activity mapped to an approved AI agent or tool policy.\n>\n> 🔴 **Unsanctioned** — recognised AI agent or tool activity not mapped to an approved policy.\n>\n> ⚠️ **If no agents are selected, all recognised AI agent and tool activity will be classified as unsanctioned.**\n\nThe workbook primarily uses:\n**DeviceProcessEvents** — execution of recognised local AI agents, model hosts and related tooling.\n**OfficeActivity** — Microsoft 365 and Purview audit activity associated with cloud agents.\n**AuditLogs** — Microsoft Entra audit activity associated with cloud agents.\n**AADServicePrincipalSignInLogs** — Microsoft Entra service-principal sign-in activity associated with cloud agents.\n\nThe optional **AIAgentGovernance** watchlist can add customer-specific AI agents and tools, override matching public catalogue evidence, and define default sanctioned selections. The workbook continues to operate with the public catalogue when the watchlist is absent. Cloud sources are queried opportunistically; unavailable tables are ignored."
            },
            "customWidth": "70",
            "name": "text - 19"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ============================================================\n// AI AGENT / TOOL DETECTION\n//\n// Reads ai_agent_watchlist.csv.\n// Matches LOCAL agents and runtimes against DeviceProcessEvents.\n//\n// Cloud rows are excluded because cloud agents require separate\n// telemetry such as OfficeActivity, Security Copilot, Entra,\n// Purview, or vendor APIs.\n// ============================================================\n\n// ============================================================\n// AI AGENT WATCHLIST\n// ============================================================\n\nlet AgentWatchlist =\n    externaldata(\n        Name:string,\n        Category:string,\n        MatchField:string,\n        Pattern:string,\n        MatchType:string,\n        RiskLevel:string,\n        DefaultAction:string,\n        Reason:string,\n        SourceURL:string,\n        Vendor:string,\n        SourceFrom:string,\n        TelemetrySource:string\n    )\n    [\n        @\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quorumcyber-workbooks/workbooks/main/Files/QCDataTypes/ai_agent_watchlist.csv\"\n    ]\n    with (\n        format=\"csv\",\n        ignoreFirstRecord=true\n    )\n    | extend\n        SearchPattern =\n            tolower(\n                case(\n                    MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                        replace_string(\n                            replace_string(Pattern, \"*\", \"\"),\n                            \"?\",\n                            \"\"\n                        ),\n                    Pattern\n                )\n            )\n    | where SourceFrom =~ \"Local\"\n    | where MatchField in~ (\n        \"FileName\",\n        \"ProcessCommandLine\"\n    )\n    | where TelemetrySource contains \"DeviceProcessEvents\"\n    | where isnotempty(SearchPattern);\n\n// ============================================================\n// SANCTIONED AI AGENT POLICY KEYS\n// ============================================================\nlet SanctionedAgents =\n    dynamic([{SanctionedAgents}]);\n\nlet SelectedAgentKeys =\n    toscalar(\n        print SelectedValue = SanctionedAgents\n        | mv-expand SelectedValue\n        | extend SelectedKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(SelectedValue)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            )\n        | where isnotempty(SelectedKey)\n        | summarize make_set(SelectedKey, 500)\n    );\n\n// ============================================================\n// BUILD SEARCH LIST\n// ============================================================\n\nlet WatchPatterns =\n    toscalar(\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | summarize make_set(SearchPattern, 500)\n    );\n\n// ============================================================\n// CANDIDATE PROCESS EVENTS\n// ============================================================\nlet CandidateProcesses =\n    DeviceProcessEvents\n    | where Timestamp between (\n        {TimeRange:start}\n        ..\n        {TimeRange:end}\n    )\n    | where isnotempty(DeviceName)\n    | extend\n        FileNameLower =\n            tolower(\n                coalesce(\n                    FileName,\n                    \"\"\n                )\n            ),\n        CommandLineLower =\n            tolower(\n                coalesce(\n                    ProcessCommandLine,\n                    \"\"\n                )\n            ),\n        SearchText =\n            tolower(\n                strcat(\n                    FileName,\n                    \" \",\n                    FolderPath,\n                    \" \",\n                    ProcessCommandLine,\n                    \" \",\n                    ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n                    \" \",\n                    ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName\n                )\n            )\n    | where SearchText has_any(WatchPatterns)\n    | extend\n        EventKey =\n            strcat(\n                tostring(Timestamp),\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(DeviceId),\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(FileName),\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(ProcessCommandLine)\n            )\n    | project\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User =\n            tostring(\n                coalesce(\n                    InitiatingProcessAccountUpn,\n                    InitiatingProcessAccountName\n                )\n            ),\n        FileName,\n        FileNameLower,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n        CommandLineLower,\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// FILENAME MATCHES\n// ============================================================\n\nlet FileNameMatches =\n    CandidateProcesses\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\n    | join kind=inner (\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | where MatchField =~ \"FileName\"\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\n    ) on JoinKey\n    | extend\n        IsMatch =\n            case(\n                MatchType =~ \"Exact\",\n                    FileNameLower == SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Contains\",\n                    FileNameLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                    FileNameLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Prefix\",\n                    FileNameLower startswith SearchPattern,\n\n                false\n            )\n    | where IsMatch\n    | extend\n        MatchedOn = \"FileName\"\n    | project\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User,\n\n        Name,\n        Category,\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n        SourceURL,\n        Vendor,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n\n        MatchedOn,\n        Pattern,\n\n        FileName,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// COMMAND-LINE MATCHES\n// ============================================================\n\nlet CommandLineMatches =\n    CandidateProcesses\n    | where isnotempty(ProcessCommandLine)\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\n    | join kind=inner (\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | where MatchField =~ \"ProcessCommandLine\"\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\n    ) on JoinKey\n    | extend\n        IsMatch =\n            case(\n                MatchType =~ \"Exact\",\n                    CommandLineLower == SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Contains\",\n                    CommandLineLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                    CommandLineLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Prefix\",\n                    CommandLineLower startswith SearchPattern,\n\n                false\n            )\n    | where IsMatch\n    | extend\n        MatchedOn = \"ProcessCommandLine\"\n    | project\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User,\n        Name,\n        Category,\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n        SourceURL,\n        Vendor,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n\n        MatchedOn,\n        Pattern,\n\n        FileName,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// COMBINE AND DEDUPLICATE EVENT MATCHES\n// ============================================================\n\nlet EventMatches =\n    union\n        FileNameMatches,\n        CommandLineMatches\n    | summarize\n        MatchedFields =\n            make_set(\n                MatchedOn,\n                10\n            ),\n\n        MatchedPatterns =\n            make_set(\n                Pattern,\n                50\n            ),\n\n        MatchedSources =\n            make_set(\n                SourceURL,\n                10\n            )\n      by\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User,\n\n        Name,\n        Vendor,\n        Category,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n\n        FileName,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n\n        SHA256;\n\n\n// ============================================================\n// LOCAL AI AGENT GOVERNANCE AT A GLANCE\n// ============================================================\nlet LocalObservedAgents =\n    EventMatches\n    | extend AgentKey = replace_regex(tolower(tostring(Name)), \"[^a-z0-9]\", \"\")\n    | summarize by AgentKey;\nlet LocalConfiguredCount =\n    toscalar(\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | extend AgentKey = replace_regex(tolower(tostring(Name)), \"[^a-z0-9]\", \"\")\n        | where SourceFrom =~ \"Local\"\n        | where set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, AgentKey)\n        | summarize dcount(AgentKey)\n    );\nlet LocalSanctionedObserved =\n    toscalar(\n        LocalObservedAgents\n        | where set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, AgentKey)\n        | summarize dcount(AgentKey)\n    );\nlet LocalUnsanctionedObserved =\n    toscalar(\n        LocalObservedAgents\n        | where set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, AgentKey) == false\n        | summarize dcount(AgentKey)\n    );\nlet LocalSanctionedNotObserved =\n    iff(LocalConfiguredCount > LocalSanctionedObserved, LocalConfiguredCount - LocalSanctionedObserved, 0);\nunion\n    (print SortOrder = 1, Metric = \"🟢 Sanctioned Agents Observed\", Value = tolong(LocalSanctionedObserved), Detail = \"Selected local agents with evidence in the period\"),\n    (print SortOrder = 2, Metric = \"🔴 Unsanctioned Agents Observed\", Value = tolong(LocalUnsanctionedObserved), Detail = \"Recognised local agents not in the selection\"),\n    (print SortOrder = 3, Metric = \"⚪ Sanctioned Agents Not Observed\", Value = tolong(LocalSanctionedNotObserved), Detail = \"Selected local agents with no evidence in the period\")\n| order by SortOrder asc\n| project Metric, Value, Detail",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "📊 Local AI Agent Governance at a Glance",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{ws}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Metric",
                  "formatter": 1
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "none"
                  },
                  "numberFormat": {
                    "unit": 17,
                    "options": {
                      "style": "decimal",
                      "maximumFractionDigits": 0,
                      "maximumSignificantDigits": 3
                    }
                  }
                },
                "showBorder": false
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "query - Local Agent Governance at a Glance"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ============================================================\n// AI AGENT / TOOL DETECTION\n//\n// Reads ai_agent_watchlist.csv.\n// Matches LOCAL agents and runtimes against DeviceProcessEvents.\n//\n// Cloud rows are excluded because cloud agents require separate\n// telemetry such as OfficeActivity, Security Copilot, Entra,\n// Purview, or vendor APIs.\n// ============================================================\n\n// ============================================================\n// AI AGENT WATCHLIST\n// ============================================================\n\nlet AgentWatchlist =\n    externaldata(\n        Name:string,\n        Category:string,\n        MatchField:string,\n        Pattern:string,\n        MatchType:string,\n        RiskLevel:string,\n        DefaultAction:string,\n        Reason:string,\n        SourceURL:string,\n        Vendor:string,\n        SourceFrom:string,\n        TelemetrySource:string\n    )\n    [\n        @\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quorumcyber-workbooks/workbooks/main/Files/QCDataTypes/ai_agent_watchlist.csv\"\n    ]\n    with (\n        format=\"csv\",\n        ignoreFirstRecord=true\n    )\n    | extend\n        SearchPattern =\n            tolower(\n                case(\n                    MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                        replace_string(\n                            replace_string(Pattern, \"*\", \"\"),\n                            \"?\",\n                            \"\"\n                        ),\n                    Pattern\n                )\n            )\n    | where SourceFrom =~ \"Local\"\n    | where MatchField in~ (\n        \"FileName\",\n        \"ProcessCommandLine\"\n    )\n    | where TelemetrySource contains \"DeviceProcessEvents\"\n    | where isnotempty(SearchPattern);\n\n// ============================================================\n// SANCTIONED AI AGENT POLICY KEYS\n// ============================================================\nlet SanctionedAgents =\n    dynamic([{SanctionedAgents}]);\n\nlet SelectedAgentKeys =\n    toscalar(\n        print SelectedValue = SanctionedAgents\n        | mv-expand SelectedValue\n        | extend SelectedKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(SelectedValue)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            )\n        | where isnotempty(SelectedKey)\n        | summarize make_set(SelectedKey, 500)\n    );\n\n// ============================================================\n// BUILD SEARCH LIST\n// ============================================================\n\nlet WatchPatterns =\n    toscalar(\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | summarize make_set(SearchPattern, 500)\n    );\n\n// ============================================================\n// CANDIDATE PROCESS EVENTS\n// ============================================================\nlet CandidateProcesses =\n    DeviceProcessEvents\n    | where Timestamp between (\n        {TimeRange:start}\n        ..\n        {TimeRange:end}\n    )\n    | where isnotempty(DeviceName)\n    | extend\n        FileNameLower =\n            tolower(\n                coalesce(\n                    FileName,\n                    \"\"\n                )\n            ),\n        CommandLineLower =\n            tolower(\n                coalesce(\n                    ProcessCommandLine,\n                    \"\"\n                )\n            ),\n        SearchText =\n            tolower(\n                strcat(\n                    FileName,\n                    \" \",\n                    FolderPath,\n                    \" \",\n                    ProcessCommandLine,\n                    \" \",\n                    ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n                    \" \",\n                    ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName\n                )\n            )\n    | where SearchText has_any(WatchPatterns)\n    | extend\n        EventKey =\n            strcat(\n                tostring(Timestamp),\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(DeviceId),\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(FileName),\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(ProcessCommandLine)\n            )\n    | project\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User =\n            tostring(\n                coalesce(\n                    InitiatingProcessAccountUpn,\n                    InitiatingProcessAccountName\n                )\n            ),\n        FileName,\n        FileNameLower,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n        CommandLineLower,\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// FILENAME MATCHES\n// ============================================================\n\nlet FileNameMatches =\n    CandidateProcesses\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\n    | join kind=inner (\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | where MatchField =~ \"FileName\"\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\n    ) on JoinKey\n    | extend\n        IsMatch =\n            case(\n                MatchType =~ \"Exact\",\n                    FileNameLower == SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Contains\",\n                    FileNameLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                    FileNameLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Prefix\",\n                    FileNameLower startswith SearchPattern,\n\n                false\n            )\n    | where IsMatch\n    | extend\n        MatchedOn = \"FileName\"\n    | project\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User,\n\n        Name,\n        Category,\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n        SourceURL,\n        Vendor,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n\n        MatchedOn,\n        Pattern,\n\n        FileName,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// COMMAND-LINE MATCHES\n// ============================================================\n\nlet CommandLineMatches =\n    CandidateProcesses\n    | where isnotempty(ProcessCommandLine)\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\n    | join kind=inner (\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | where MatchField =~ \"ProcessCommandLine\"\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\n    ) on JoinKey\n    | extend\n        IsMatch =\n            case(\n                MatchType =~ \"Exact\",\n                    CommandLineLower == SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Contains\",\n                    CommandLineLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                    CommandLineLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Prefix\",\n                    CommandLineLower startswith SearchPattern,\n\n                false\n            )\n    | where IsMatch\n    | extend\n        MatchedOn = \"ProcessCommandLine\"\n    | project\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User,\n        Name,\n        Category,\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n        SourceURL,\n        Vendor,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n\n        MatchedOn,\n        Pattern,\n\n        FileName,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// COMBINE AND DEDUPLICATE EVENT MATCHES\n// ============================================================\n\nlet EventMatches =\n    union\n        FileNameMatches,\n        CommandLineMatches\n    | summarize\n        MatchedFields =\n            make_set(\n                MatchedOn,\n                10\n            ),\n\n        MatchedPatterns =\n            make_set(\n                Pattern,\n                50\n            ),\n\n        MatchedSources =\n            make_set(\n                SourceURL,\n                10\n            )\n      by\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User,\n\n        Name,\n        Vendor,\n        Category,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n\n        FileName,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n\n        SHA256;\n\n\n// ============================================================\n// LOCAL SANCTIONED AGENTS NOT OBSERVED\n// ============================================================\nlet LocalObservedAgents =\n    EventMatches\n    | extend AgentKey = replace_regex(tolower(tostring(Name)), \"[^a-z0-9]\", \"\")\n    | summarize by AgentKey;\nAgentWatchlist\n| extend AgentKey = replace_regex(tolower(tostring(Name)), \"[^a-z0-9]\", \"\")\n| where SourceFrom =~ \"Local\"\n| where set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, AgentKey)\n| where AgentKey !in (LocalObservedAgents | project AgentKey)\n| summarize Vendor = take_any(Vendor), Category = take_any(Category), Sources = make_set(SourceURL, 10) by AgentKey, Tool = Name\n| project Tool, Vendor, Category, Sources = strcat_array(Sources, \", \")\n| order by Tool asc",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "⚪ Local Sanctioned Agents Not Observed - {$rowCount}",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{ws}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table",
              "tileSettings": {
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Tool"
                },
                "showBorder": false
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "query - Local Sanctioned Agents Not Observed"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ============================================================\n// CLOUD AI AGENT / TOOL DETECTION\n// ============================================================\n// Reads cloud rows from ai_agent_watchlist.csv.\n// Missing source tables are ignored with union isfuzzy=true.\n// Produces one row per normalized cloud agent.\n// ============================================================\n// ============================================================\n// WATCHLIST\n// ============================================================\nlet AgentWatchlist =\n    externaldata(\n        Name:string,\n        Category:string,\n        MatchField:string,\n        Pattern:string,\n        MatchType:string,\n        RiskLevel:string,\n        DefaultAction:string,\n        Reason:string,\n        SourceURL:string,\n        Vendor:string,\n        SourceFrom:string,\n        TelemetrySource:string\n    )\n    [\n        @\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quorumcyber-workbooks/workbooks/main/Files/QCDataTypes/ai_agent_watchlist.csv\"\n    ]\n    with (\n        format=\"csv\",\n        ignoreFirstRecord=true\n    )\n    | extend\n        SourceFrom =\n            trim(\n                @\"[\\s]+\",\n                tostring(SourceFrom)\n            ),\n        AgentKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(Name)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            ),\n        SearchPattern =\n            tolower(\n                case(\n                    MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                        replace_string(\n                            replace_string(Pattern, \"*\", \"\"),\n                            \"?\",\n                            \"\"\n                        ),\n                    Pattern\n                )\n            )\n    | where tolower(SourceFrom) == \"cloud\"\n    | where isnotempty(AgentKey)\n    | where isnotempty(SearchPattern)\n    | distinct\n        Name,\n        Category,\n        MatchField,\n        Pattern,\n        MatchType,\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n        SourceURL,\n        Vendor,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n        AgentKey,\n        SearchPattern;\n// ============================================================\n// SANCTIONED AI AGENT POLICY KEYS\n// ============================================================\nlet SanctionedAgents =\n    dynamic([{SanctionedAgents}]);\n\nlet SelectedAgentKeys =\n    toscalar(\n        print SelectedValue = SanctionedAgents\n        | mv-expand SelectedValue\n        | extend SelectedKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(SelectedValue)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            )\n        | where isnotempty(SelectedKey)\n        | summarize make_set(SelectedKey, 500)\n    );\n\n// ============================================================\n// OPTIONAL CLOUD TABLES\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudEvents =\n    union isfuzzy=true\n    (\n        // Microsoft 365 and Purview audit activity\n        OfficeActivity\n        | where TimeGenerated between (\n            {TimeRange:start}\n            ..\n            {TimeRange:end}\n        )\n        | extend\n            EventTime = TimeGenerated,\n            RecordId = tostring(OfficeId),\n            Actor = tostring(coalesce(UserId, Actor, Application)),\n            ActorIP = tostring(coalesce(ClientIP, ActorIpAddress, Client_IPAddress)),\n            OperationText = tostring(coalesce(Operation, Activity)),\n            ResourceText = tostring(coalesce(Application, OfficeWorkload, OfficeObjectId, ItemName, TeamName, ChatName)),\n            SearchText =\n                tolower(\n                    strcat(\n                        UserId,\n                        \" \",\n                        Actor,\n                        \" \",\n                        Application,\n                        \" \",\n                        Operation,\n                        \" \",\n                        Activity,\n                        \" \",\n                        OfficeWorkload,\n                        \" \",\n                        AddonName,\n                        \" \",\n                        CustomEvent,\n                        \" \",\n                        Parameters,\n                        \" \",\n                        ModifiedProperties,\n                        \" \",\n                        OfficeObjectId,\n                        \" \",\n                        ItemName,\n                        \" \",\n                        TeamName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ChatName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ChannelName\n                    )\n                ),\n            Evidence =\n                strcat(\n                    \"Operation=\",\n                    Operation,\n                    \"; Activity=\",\n                    Activity,\n                    \"; Application=\",\n                    Application,\n                    \"; OfficeWorkload=\",\n                    OfficeWorkload,\n                    \"; Item=\",\n                    ItemName,\n                    \"; Resource=\",\n                    OfficeObjectId,\n                    \"; Parameters=\",\n                    Parameters\n                )\n        | project\n            ObservedTable = \"OfficeActivity\",\n            EventTime,\n            RecordId,\n            Actor,\n            ActorIP,\n            OperationText,\n            ResourceText,\n            SearchText,\n            Evidence\n    ),\n    (\n        // Microsoft Entra audit activity\n        AuditLogs\n        | where TimeGenerated between (\n            {TimeRange:start}\n            ..\n            {TimeRange:end}\n        )\n        | extend\n            EventTime = TimeGenerated,\n            RecordId = tostring(Id),\n            Actor = tostring(coalesce(InitiatedBy.user.userPrincipalName, InitiatedBy.app.displayName, Identity)),\n            ActorIP = \"\",\n            OperationText = tostring(coalesce(ActivityDisplayName, OperationName)),\n            ResourceText = tostring(ResourceId),\n            SearchText =\n                tolower(\n                    strcat(\n                        ActivityDisplayName,\n                        \" \",\n                        OperationName,\n                        \" \",\n                        Identity,\n                        \" \",\n                        tostring(InitiatedBy),\n                        \" \",\n                        tostring(TargetResources),\n                        \" \",\n                        tostring(AdditionalDetails),\n                        \" \",\n                        LoggedByService,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceProvider,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceId,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResultDescription\n                    )\n                ),\n            Evidence =\n                strcat(\n                    \"Activity=\",\n                    ActivityDisplayName,\n                    \"; Operation=\",\n                    OperationName,\n                    \"; Identity=\",\n                    Identity,\n                    \"; InitiatedBy=\",\n                    tostring(InitiatedBy),\n                    \"; TargetResources=\",\n                    tostring(TargetResources),\n                    \"; Result=\",\n                    ResultType,\n                    \"; Description=\",\n                    ResultDescription\n                )\n        | project\n            ObservedTable = \"AuditLogs\",\n            EventTime,\n            RecordId,\n            Actor,\n            ActorIP,\n            OperationText,\n            ResourceText,\n            SearchText,\n            Evidence\n    ),\n    (\n        // Microsoft Entra service-principal sign-ins\n        AADServicePrincipalSignInLogs\n        | where TimeGenerated between (\n            {TimeRange:start}\n            ..\n            {TimeRange:end}\n        )\n        | extend\n            EventTime = TimeGenerated,\n            RecordId = tostring(Id),\n            Actor = tostring(coalesce(ServicePrincipalName, ServicePrincipalId, AppId, Identity)),\n            ActorIP = tostring(IPAddress),\n            OperationText = tostring(OperationName),\n            ResourceText = tostring(coalesce(ResourceDisplayName, ResourceIdentity, ResourceServicePrincipalId)),\n            SearchText =\n                tolower(\n                    strcat(\n                        ServicePrincipalName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ServicePrincipalId,\n                        \" \",\n                        AppId,\n                        \" \",\n                        Identity,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceDisplayName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceIdentity,\n                        \" \",\n                        Agent,\n                        \" \",\n                        OperationName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResultType,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResultDescription,\n                        \" \",\n                        UserAgent\n                    )\n                ),\n            Evidence =\n                strcat(\n                    \"ServicePrincipal=\",\n                    ServicePrincipalName,\n                    \"; ServicePrincipalId=\",\n                    ServicePrincipalId,\n                    \"; AppId=\",\n                    AppId,\n                    \"; Resource=\",\n                    ResourceDisplayName,\n                    \"; Result=\",\n                    ResultType,\n                    \"; Description=\",\n                    ResultDescription,\n                    \"; UserAgent=\",\n                    UserAgent\n                )\n        | project\n            ObservedTable = \"AADServicePrincipalSignInLogs\",\n            EventTime,\n            RecordId,\n            Actor,\n            ActorIP,\n            OperationText,\n            ResourceText,\n            SearchText,\n            Evidence\n    );\n// ============================================================\n// BUILD CLOUD SEARCH LIST\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudPatterns =\n    toscalar(\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | summarize make_set(SearchPattern, 500)\n    );\n// ============================================================\n// CANDIDATE CLOUD EVENTS\n// ============================================================\nlet CandidateCloudEvents =\n    CloudEvents\n    | where EventTime between (\n        {TimeRange:start}\n        ..\n        {TimeRange:end}\n    )\n    | where isnotempty(SearchText)\n    | where SearchText has_any(CloudPatterns)\n    | extend\n        EventKey =\n            strcat(\n                ObservedTable,\n                \"|\",\n                RecordId,\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(EventTime),\n                \"|\",\n                Actor,\n                \"|\",\n                OperationText\n            );\n// ============================================================\n// MATCH CLOUD WATCHLIST\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudMatches =\n    CandidateCloudEvents\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\n    | join kind=inner (\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\n    ) on JoinKey\n    | where SearchText contains SearchPattern\n    | summarize\n        arg_max(EventTime, *)\n      by\n        EventKey,\n        AgentKey,\n        Vendor,\n        Pattern,\n        SourceFrom;\n\n// ============================================================\n// CLOUD AI AGENT GOVERNANCE AT A GLANCE\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudObservedAgents =\n    CloudMatches\n    | summarize by AgentKey;\nlet CloudConfiguredCount =\n    toscalar(\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | where SourceFrom =~ \"Cloud\"\n        | where set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, AgentKey)\n        | summarize dcount(AgentKey)\n    );\nlet CloudSanctionedObserved =\n    toscalar(\n        CloudObservedAgents\n        | where set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, AgentKey)\n        | summarize dcount(AgentKey)\n    );\nlet CloudUnsanctionedObserved =\n    toscalar(\n        CloudObservedAgents\n        | where set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, AgentKey) == false\n        | summarize dcount(AgentKey)\n    );\nlet CloudSanctionedNotObserved =\n    iff(CloudConfiguredCount > CloudSanctionedObserved, CloudConfiguredCount - CloudSanctionedObserved, 0);\nunion\n    (print SortOrder = 1, Metric = \"🟢 Sanctioned Agents Observed\", Value = tolong(CloudSanctionedObserved), Detail = \"Selected cloud agents with evidence in the period\"),\n    (print SortOrder = 2, Metric = \"🔴 Unsanctioned Agents Observed\", Value = tolong(CloudUnsanctionedObserved), Detail = \"Recognised cloud agents not in the selection\"),\n    (print SortOrder = 3, Metric = \"⚪ Sanctioned Agents Not Observed\", Value = tolong(CloudSanctionedNotObserved), Detail = \"Selected cloud agents with no evidence in the period\")\n| order by SortOrder asc\n| project Metric, Value, Detail",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "☁️ Cloud AI Agent Governance at a Glance",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{ws}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Metric",
                  "formatter": 1
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "none"
                  },
                  "numberFormat": {
                    "unit": 17,
                    "options": {
                      "style": "decimal",
                      "maximumFractionDigits": 0,
                      "maximumSignificantDigits": 3
                    }
                  }
                },
                "showBorder": false
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "query - Cloud Agent Governance at a Glance"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ============================================================\n// CLOUD AI AGENT / TOOL DETECTION\n// ============================================================\n// Reads cloud rows from ai_agent_watchlist.csv.\n// Missing source tables are ignored with union isfuzzy=true.\n// Produces one row per normalized cloud agent.\n// ============================================================\n// ============================================================\n// WATCHLIST\n// ============================================================\nlet AgentWatchlist =\n    externaldata(\n        Name:string,\n        Category:string,\n        MatchField:string,\n        Pattern:string,\n        MatchType:string,\n        RiskLevel:string,\n        DefaultAction:string,\n        Reason:string,\n        SourceURL:string,\n        Vendor:string,\n        SourceFrom:string,\n        TelemetrySource:string\n    )\n    [\n        @\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quorumcyber-workbooks/workbooks/main/Files/QCDataTypes/ai_agent_watchlist.csv\"\n    ]\n    with (\n        format=\"csv\",\n        ignoreFirstRecord=true\n    )\n    | extend\n        SourceFrom =\n            trim(\n                @\"[\\s]+\",\n                tostring(SourceFrom)\n            ),\n        AgentKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(Name)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            ),\n        SearchPattern =\n            tolower(\n                case(\n                    MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                        replace_string(\n                            replace_string(Pattern, \"*\", \"\"),\n                            \"?\",\n                            \"\"\n                        ),\n                    Pattern\n                )\n            )\n    | where tolower(SourceFrom) == \"cloud\"\n    | where isnotempty(AgentKey)\n    | where isnotempty(SearchPattern)\n    | distinct\n        Name,\n        Category,\n        MatchField,\n        Pattern,\n        MatchType,\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n        SourceURL,\n        Vendor,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n        AgentKey,\n        SearchPattern;\n// ============================================================\n// SANCTIONED AI AGENT POLICY KEYS\n// ============================================================\nlet SanctionedAgents =\n    dynamic([{SanctionedAgents}]);\n\nlet SelectedAgentKeys =\n    toscalar(\n        print SelectedValue = SanctionedAgents\n        | mv-expand SelectedValue\n        | extend SelectedKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(SelectedValue)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            )\n        | where isnotempty(SelectedKey)\n        | summarize make_set(SelectedKey, 500)\n    );\n\n// ============================================================\n// OPTIONAL CLOUD TABLES\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudEvents =\n    union isfuzzy=true\n    (\n        // Microsoft 365 and Purview audit activity\n        OfficeActivity\n        | where TimeGenerated between (\n            {TimeRange:start}\n            ..\n            {TimeRange:end}\n        )\n        | extend\n            EventTime = TimeGenerated,\n            RecordId = tostring(OfficeId),\n            Actor = tostring(coalesce(UserId, Actor, Application)),\n            ActorIP = tostring(coalesce(ClientIP, ActorIpAddress, Client_IPAddress)),\n            OperationText = tostring(coalesce(Operation, Activity)),\n            ResourceText = tostring(coalesce(Application, OfficeWorkload, OfficeObjectId, ItemName, TeamName, ChatName)),\n            SearchText =\n                tolower(\n                    strcat(\n                        UserId,\n                        \" \",\n                        Actor,\n                        \" \",\n                        Application,\n                        \" \",\n                        Operation,\n                        \" \",\n                        Activity,\n                        \" \",\n                        OfficeWorkload,\n                        \" \",\n                        AddonName,\n                        \" \",\n                        CustomEvent,\n                        \" \",\n                        Parameters,\n                        \" \",\n                        ModifiedProperties,\n                        \" \",\n                        OfficeObjectId,\n                        \" \",\n                        ItemName,\n                        \" \",\n                        TeamName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ChatName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ChannelName\n                    )\n                ),\n            Evidence =\n                strcat(\n                    \"Operation=\",\n                    Operation,\n                    \"; Activity=\",\n                    Activity,\n                    \"; Application=\",\n                    Application,\n                    \"; OfficeWorkload=\",\n                    OfficeWorkload,\n                    \"; Item=\",\n                    ItemName,\n                    \"; Resource=\",\n                    OfficeObjectId,\n                    \"; Parameters=\",\n                    Parameters\n                )\n        | project\n            ObservedTable = \"OfficeActivity\",\n            EventTime,\n            RecordId,\n            Actor,\n            ActorIP,\n            OperationText,\n            ResourceText,\n            SearchText,\n            Evidence\n    ),\n    (\n        // Microsoft Entra audit activity\n        AuditLogs\n        | where TimeGenerated between (\n            {TimeRange:start}\n            ..\n            {TimeRange:end}\n        )\n        | extend\n            EventTime = TimeGenerated,\n            RecordId = tostring(Id),\n            Actor = tostring(coalesce(InitiatedBy.user.userPrincipalName, InitiatedBy.app.displayName, Identity)),\n            ActorIP = \"\",\n            OperationText = tostring(coalesce(ActivityDisplayName, OperationName)),\n            ResourceText = tostring(ResourceId),\n            SearchText =\n                tolower(\n                    strcat(\n                        ActivityDisplayName,\n                        \" \",\n                        OperationName,\n                        \" \",\n                        Identity,\n                        \" \",\n                        tostring(InitiatedBy),\n                        \" \",\n                        tostring(TargetResources),\n                        \" \",\n                        tostring(AdditionalDetails),\n                        \" \",\n                        LoggedByService,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceProvider,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceId,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResultDescription\n                    )\n                ),\n            Evidence =\n                strcat(\n                    \"Activity=\",\n                    ActivityDisplayName,\n                    \"; Operation=\",\n                    OperationName,\n                    \"; Identity=\",\n                    Identity,\n                    \"; InitiatedBy=\",\n                    tostring(InitiatedBy),\n                    \"; TargetResources=\",\n                    tostring(TargetResources),\n                    \"; Result=\",\n                    ResultType,\n                    \"; Description=\",\n                    ResultDescription\n                )\n        | project\n            ObservedTable = \"AuditLogs\",\n            EventTime,\n            RecordId,\n            Actor,\n            ActorIP,\n            OperationText,\n            ResourceText,\n            SearchText,\n            Evidence\n    ),\n    (\n        // Microsoft Entra service-principal sign-ins\n        AADServicePrincipalSignInLogs\n        | where TimeGenerated between (\n            {TimeRange:start}\n            ..\n            {TimeRange:end}\n        )\n        | extend\n            EventTime = TimeGenerated,\n            RecordId = tostring(Id),\n            Actor = tostring(coalesce(ServicePrincipalName, ServicePrincipalId, AppId, Identity)),\n            ActorIP = tostring(IPAddress),\n            OperationText = tostring(OperationName),\n            ResourceText = tostring(coalesce(ResourceDisplayName, ResourceIdentity, ResourceServicePrincipalId)),\n            SearchText =\n                tolower(\n                    strcat(\n                        ServicePrincipalName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ServicePrincipalId,\n                        \" \",\n                        AppId,\n                        \" \",\n                        Identity,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceDisplayName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceIdentity,\n                        \" \",\n                        Agent,\n                        \" \",\n                        OperationName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResultType,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResultDescription,\n                        \" \",\n                        UserAgent\n                    )\n                ),\n            Evidence =\n                strcat(\n                    \"ServicePrincipal=\",\n                    ServicePrincipalName,\n                    \"; ServicePrincipalId=\",\n                    ServicePrincipalId,\n                    \"; AppId=\",\n                    AppId,\n                    \"; Resource=\",\n                    ResourceDisplayName,\n                    \"; Result=\",\n                    ResultType,\n                    \"; Description=\",\n                    ResultDescription,\n                    \"; UserAgent=\",\n                    UserAgent\n                )\n        | project\n            ObservedTable = \"AADServicePrincipalSignInLogs\",\n            EventTime,\n            RecordId,\n            Actor,\n            ActorIP,\n            OperationText,\n            ResourceText,\n            SearchText,\n            Evidence\n    );\n// ============================================================\n// BUILD CLOUD SEARCH LIST\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudPatterns =\n    toscalar(\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | summarize make_set(SearchPattern, 500)\n    );\n// ============================================================\n// CANDIDATE CLOUD EVENTS\n// ============================================================\nlet CandidateCloudEvents =\n    CloudEvents\n    | where EventTime between (\n        {TimeRange:start}\n        ..\n        {TimeRange:end}\n    )\n    | where isnotempty(SearchText)\n    | where SearchText has_any(CloudPatterns)\n    | extend\n        EventKey =\n            strcat(\n                ObservedTable,\n                \"|\",\n                RecordId,\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(EventTime),\n                \"|\",\n                Actor,\n                \"|\",\n                OperationText\n            );\n// ============================================================\n// MATCH CLOUD WATCHLIST\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudMatches =\n    CandidateCloudEvents\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\n    | join kind=inner (\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\n    ) on JoinKey\n    | where SearchText contains SearchPattern\n    | summarize\n        arg_max(EventTime, *)\n      by\n        EventKey,\n        AgentKey,\n        Vendor,\n        Pattern,\n        SourceFrom;\n\n// ============================================================\n// CLOUD SANCTIONED AGENTS NOT OBSERVED\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudObservedAgents =\n    CloudMatches\n    | summarize by AgentKey;\nAgentWatchlist\n| where SourceFrom =~ \"Cloud\"\n| where set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, AgentKey)\n| where AgentKey !in (CloudObservedAgents | project AgentKey)\n| summarize Vendor = take_any(Vendor), Category = take_any(Category), Sources = make_set(SourceURL, 10) by AgentKey, Tool = Name\n| project Tool, Vendor, Category, Sources = strcat_array(Sources, \", \")\n| order by Tool asc",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "⚪ Cloud Sanctioned Agents Not Observed - {$rowCount}",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{ws}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table",
              "tileSettings": {
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Tool"
                },
                "showBorder": false
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "query - Cloud Sanctioned Agents Not Observed"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ============================================================\n// AI AGENT / TOOL DETECTION\n//\n// Reads ai_agent_watchlist.csv.\n// Matches LOCAL agents and runtimes against DeviceProcessEvents.\n//\n// Cloud rows are excluded because cloud agents require separate\n// telemetry such as OfficeActivity, Security Copilot, Entra,\n// Purview, or vendor APIs.\n// ============================================================\n\n// ============================================================\n// AI AGENT WATCHLIST\n// ============================================================\n\nlet AgentWatchlist =\n    externaldata(\n        Name:string,\n        Category:string,\n        MatchField:string,\n        Pattern:string,\n        MatchType:string,\n        RiskLevel:string,\n        DefaultAction:string,\n        Reason:string,\n        SourceURL:string,\n        Vendor:string,\n        SourceFrom:string,\n        TelemetrySource:string\n    )\n    [\n        @\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quorumcyber-workbooks/workbooks/main/Files/QCDataTypes/ai_agent_watchlist.csv\"\n    ]\n    with (\n        format=\"csv\",\n        ignoreFirstRecord=true\n    )\n    | extend\n        SearchPattern =\n            tolower(\n                case(\n                    MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                        replace_string(\n                            replace_string(Pattern, \"*\", \"\"),\n                            \"?\",\n                            \"\"\n                        ),\n                    Pattern\n                )\n            )\n    | where SourceFrom =~ \"Local\"\n    | where MatchField in~ (\n        \"FileName\",\n        \"ProcessCommandLine\"\n    )\n    | where TelemetrySource contains \"DeviceProcessEvents\"\n    | where isnotempty(SearchPattern);\n\n// ============================================================\n// SANCTIONED AI AGENT POLICY KEYS\n// ============================================================\nlet SanctionedAgents =\n    dynamic([{SanctionedAgents}]);\n\nlet SelectedAgentKeys =\n    toscalar(\n        print SelectedValue = SanctionedAgents\n        | mv-expand SelectedValue\n        | extend SelectedKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(SelectedValue)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            )\n        | where isnotempty(SelectedKey)\n        | summarize make_set(SelectedKey, 500)\n    );\n\n// ============================================================\n// BUILD SEARCH LIST\n// ============================================================\n\nlet WatchPatterns =\n    toscalar(\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | summarize make_set(SearchPattern, 500)\n    );\n\n// ============================================================\n// CANDIDATE PROCESS EVENTS\n// ============================================================\nlet CandidateProcesses =\n    DeviceProcessEvents\n    | where Timestamp between (\n        {TimeRange:start}\n        ..\n        {TimeRange:end}\n    )\n    | where isnotempty(DeviceName)\n    | extend\n        FileNameLower =\n            tolower(\n                coalesce(\n                    FileName,\n                    \"\"\n                )\n            ),\n        CommandLineLower =\n            tolower(\n                coalesce(\n                    ProcessCommandLine,\n                    \"\"\n                )\n            ),\n        SearchText =\n            tolower(\n                strcat(\n                    FileName,\n                    \" \",\n                    FolderPath,\n                    \" \",\n                    ProcessCommandLine,\n                    \" \",\n                    ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n                    \" \",\n                    ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName\n                )\n            )\n    | where SearchText has_any(WatchPatterns)\n    | extend\n        EventKey =\n            strcat(\n                tostring(Timestamp),\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(DeviceId),\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(FileName),\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(ProcessCommandLine)\n            )\n    | project\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User =\n            tostring(\n                coalesce(\n                    InitiatingProcessAccountUpn,\n                    InitiatingProcessAccountName\n                )\n            ),\n        FileName,\n        FileNameLower,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n        CommandLineLower,\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// FILENAME MATCHES\n// ============================================================\n\nlet FileNameMatches =\n    CandidateProcesses\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\n    | join kind=inner (\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | where MatchField =~ \"FileName\"\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\n    ) on JoinKey\n    | extend\n        IsMatch =\n            case(\n                MatchType =~ \"Exact\",\n                    FileNameLower == SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Contains\",\n                    FileNameLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                    FileNameLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Prefix\",\n                    FileNameLower startswith SearchPattern,\n\n                false\n            )\n    | where IsMatch\n    | extend\n        MatchedOn = \"FileName\"\n    | project\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User,\n\n        Name,\n        Category,\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n        SourceURL,\n        Vendor,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n\n        MatchedOn,\n        Pattern,\n\n        FileName,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// COMMAND-LINE MATCHES\n// ============================================================\n\nlet CommandLineMatches =\n    CandidateProcesses\n    | where isnotempty(ProcessCommandLine)\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\n    | join kind=inner (\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | where MatchField =~ \"ProcessCommandLine\"\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\n    ) on JoinKey\n    | extend\n        IsMatch =\n            case(\n                MatchType =~ \"Exact\",\n                    CommandLineLower == SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Contains\",\n                    CommandLineLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                    CommandLineLower contains SearchPattern,\n\n                MatchType =~ \"Prefix\",\n                    CommandLineLower startswith SearchPattern,\n\n                false\n            )\n    | where IsMatch\n    | extend\n        MatchedOn = \"ProcessCommandLine\"\n    | project\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User,\n        Name,\n        Category,\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n        SourceURL,\n        Vendor,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n\n        MatchedOn,\n        Pattern,\n\n        FileName,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// COMBINE AND DEDUPLICATE EVENT MATCHES\n// ============================================================\n\nlet EventMatches =\n    union\n        FileNameMatches,\n        CommandLineMatches\n    | summarize\n        MatchedFields =\n            make_set(\n                MatchedOn,\n                10\n            ),\n\n        MatchedPatterns =\n            make_set(\n                Pattern,\n                50\n            ),\n\n        MatchedSources =\n            make_set(\n                SourceURL,\n                10\n            )\n      by\n        EventKey,\n        Timestamp,\n        DeviceId,\n        DeviceName,\n        User,\n\n        Name,\n        Vendor,\n        Category,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n\n        FileName,\n        FolderPath,\n        ProcessCommandLine,\n\n        ProcessVersionInfoProductName,\n        ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName,\n\n        SHA256;\n\n// ============================================================\n// SUMMARISE BY TOOL\n// ============================================================\nEventMatches\n| extend\n    ToolKey =\n        strcat_array(\n            extract_all(\n                \"([A-Za-z0-9]+)\",\n                tostring(Name)\n            ),\n            \"\"\n        )\n| summarize\n    ToolName = take_any(Name),\n    ToolVendor = take_any(Vendor),\n    ToolFrom = take_any(SourceFrom),\n    ToolTelemetrySource = take_any(TelemetrySource),\n    ToolCategory = take_any(Category),\n    ToolRiskLevel = take_any(RiskLevel),\n    ToolDefaultAction = take_any(DefaultAction),\n    ToolReason = take_any(Reason),\n    FirstSeen = min(Timestamp),\n    LastSeen = max(Timestamp),\n    Events = dcount(EventKey),\n    Users =\n        dcountif(\n            User,\n            isnotempty(User)\n        ),\n    Devices = dcount(DeviceId),\n    UserList =\n        make_set_if(\n            User,\n            isnotempty(User),\n            30\n        ),\n    DeviceList =\n        make_set_if(\n            DeviceName,\n            isnotempty(DeviceName),\n            30\n        ),\n    MatchFields =\n        make_set(\n            strcat_array(MatchedFields, \", \"),\n            10\n        ),\n    Patterns =\n        make_set(\n            strcat_array(MatchedPatterns, \", \"),\n            50\n        ),\n    Sources =\n        make_set(\n            strcat_array(MatchedSources, \", \"),\n            10\n        ),\n    ExampleProcess =\n        take_any(FileName),\n    ExampleCommandLine =\n        take_any(ProcessCommandLine),\n    ExampleProduct =\n        take_any(ProcessVersionInfoProductName),\n    ExampleCompany =\n        take_any(ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName),\n    ExamplePath =\n        take_any(FolderPath),\n    ExampleSHA256 =\n        take_any(SHA256)\n  by\n    ToolKey\n| extend\n    IsSanctioned =\n        array_length(SelectedAgentKeys) > 0\n        and set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, tolower(ToolKey))\n| extend\n    Governance =\n        iff(\n            IsSanctioned,\n            \"🟢 Sanctioned\",\n            \"🔴 Unsanctioned\"\n        ),\n    Risk =\n        case(\n            ToolRiskLevel =~ \"High\",\n                \"🔴 High\",\n            ToolRiskLevel =~ \"Medium\",\n                \"🟠 Medium\",\n            ToolRiskLevel =~ \"Low\",\n                \"🟡 Low\",\n            strcat(\"⚪ \", tostring(ToolRiskLevel))\n        ),\n    RiskOrder =\n        case(\n            ToolRiskLevel =~ \"High\",\n                1,\n            ToolRiskLevel =~ \"Medium\",\n                2,\n            ToolRiskLevel =~ \"Low\",\n                3,\n            4\n        )\n| project\n    Tool = ToolName,\n    Vendor = ToolVendor,\n    ['From'] = ToolFrom,\n    ['Telemetry Source'] = ToolTelemetrySource,\n    ['Policy Mapping'] =\n        iff(\n            IsSanctioned,\n            \"Sanctioned\",\n            \"Unsanctioned\"\n        ),\n    Governance,\n    Risk,\n    Category = ToolCategory,\n    Users,\n    Devices,\n    ['User List'] = UserList,\n    ['Device List'] = DeviceList,\n    Match =\n        strcat_array(\n            array_sort_asc(MatchFields),\n            \", \"\n        ),\n    Pattern =\n        strcat_array(\n            array_sort_asc(Patterns),\n            \", \"\n        ),\n    Sources,\n    Process = ExampleProcess,\n    CommandLine = ExampleCommandLine,\n    Product = ExampleProduct,\n    Company = ExampleCompany,\n    Events,\n    ['First Seen'] = FirstSeen,\n    ['Last Seen'] = LastSeen,\n    DefaultAction = ToolDefaultAction,\n    Reason = ToolReason,\n    ExamplePath,\n    ExampleSHA256,\n    RiskOrder\n| order by\n    RiskOrder asc,\n    Users desc,\n    Events desc,\n    ['Last Seen'] desc\n| project-away RiskOrder",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "🤖 [Local] AI Agent / Tool Detection, count: {$rowCount}",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{ws}"
              ],
              "gridSettings": {
                "filter": true
              }
            },
            "name": "query - 4"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ============================================================\n// CLOUD AI AGENT / TOOL DETECTION\n// ============================================================\n// Reads cloud rows from ai_agent_watchlist.csv.\n// Missing source tables are ignored with union isfuzzy=true.\n// Produces one row per normalized cloud agent.\n// ============================================================\n// ============================================================\n// WATCHLIST\n// ============================================================\nlet AgentWatchlist =\n    externaldata(\n        Name:string,\n        Category:string,\n        MatchField:string,\n        Pattern:string,\n        MatchType:string,\n        RiskLevel:string,\n        DefaultAction:string,\n        Reason:string,\n        SourceURL:string,\n        Vendor:string,\n        SourceFrom:string,\n        TelemetrySource:string\n    )\n    [\n        @\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quorumcyber-workbooks/workbooks/main/Files/QCDataTypes/ai_agent_watchlist.csv\"\n    ]\n    with (\n        format=\"csv\",\n        ignoreFirstRecord=true\n    )\n    | extend\n        SourceFrom =\n            trim(\n                @\"[\\s]+\",\n                tostring(SourceFrom)\n            ),\n        AgentKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(Name)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            ),\n        SearchPattern =\n            tolower(\n                case(\n                    MatchType =~ \"Wildcard\",\n                        replace_string(\n                            replace_string(Pattern, \"*\", \"\"),\n                            \"?\",\n                            \"\"\n                        ),\n                    Pattern\n                )\n            )\n    | where tolower(SourceFrom) == \"cloud\"\n    | where isnotempty(AgentKey)\n    | where isnotempty(SearchPattern)\n    | distinct\n        Name,\n        Category,\n        MatchField,\n        Pattern,\n        MatchType,\n        RiskLevel,\n        DefaultAction,\n        Reason,\n        SourceURL,\n        Vendor,\n        SourceFrom,\n        TelemetrySource,\n        AgentKey,\n        SearchPattern;\n// ============================================================\n// SANCTIONED AI AGENT POLICY KEYS\n// ============================================================\nlet SanctionedAgents =\n    dynamic([{SanctionedAgents}]);\n\nlet SelectedAgentKeys =\n    toscalar(\n        print SelectedValue = SanctionedAgents\n        | mv-expand SelectedValue\n        | extend SelectedKey =\n            replace_regex(\n                tolower(tostring(SelectedValue)),\n                \"[^a-z0-9]\",\n                \"\"\n            )\n        | where isnotempty(SelectedKey)\n        | summarize make_set(SelectedKey, 500)\n    );\n\n// ============================================================\n// OPTIONAL CLOUD TABLES\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudEvents =\n    union isfuzzy=true\n    (\n        // Microsoft 365 and Purview audit activity\n        OfficeActivity\n        | where TimeGenerated between (\n            {TimeRange:start}\n            ..\n            {TimeRange:end}\n        )\n        | extend\n            EventTime = TimeGenerated,\n            RecordId = tostring(OfficeId),\n            Actor = tostring(coalesce(UserId, Actor, Application)),\n            ActorIP = tostring(coalesce(ClientIP, ActorIpAddress, Client_IPAddress)),\n            OperationText = tostring(coalesce(Operation, Activity)),\n            ResourceText = tostring(coalesce(Application, OfficeWorkload, OfficeObjectId, ItemName, TeamName, ChatName)),\n            SearchText =\n                tolower(\n                    strcat(\n                        UserId,\n                        \" \",\n                        Actor,\n                        \" \",\n                        Application,\n                        \" \",\n                        Operation,\n                        \" \",\n                        Activity,\n                        \" \",\n                        OfficeWorkload,\n                        \" \",\n                        AddonName,\n                        \" \",\n                        CustomEvent,\n                        \" \",\n                        Parameters,\n                        \" \",\n                        ModifiedProperties,\n                        \" \",\n                        OfficeObjectId,\n                        \" \",\n                        ItemName,\n                        \" \",\n                        TeamName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ChatName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ChannelName\n                    )\n                ),\n            Evidence =\n                strcat(\n                    \"Operation=\",\n                    Operation,\n                    \"; Activity=\",\n                    Activity,\n                    \"; Application=\",\n                    Application,\n                    \"; OfficeWorkload=\",\n                    OfficeWorkload,\n                    \"; Item=\",\n                    ItemName,\n                    \"; Resource=\",\n                    OfficeObjectId,\n                    \"; Parameters=\",\n                    Parameters\n                )\n        | project\n            ObservedTable = \"OfficeActivity\",\n            EventTime,\n            RecordId,\n            Actor,\n            ActorIP,\n            OperationText,\n            ResourceText,\n            SearchText,\n            Evidence\n    ),\n    (\n        // Microsoft Entra audit activity\n        AuditLogs\n        | where TimeGenerated between (\n            {TimeRange:start}\n            ..\n            {TimeRange:end}\n        )\n        | extend\n            EventTime = TimeGenerated,\n            RecordId = tostring(Id),\n            Actor = tostring(coalesce(InitiatedBy.user.userPrincipalName, InitiatedBy.app.displayName, Identity)),\n            ActorIP = \"\",\n            OperationText = tostring(coalesce(ActivityDisplayName, OperationName)),\n            ResourceText = tostring(ResourceId),\n            SearchText =\n                tolower(\n                    strcat(\n                        ActivityDisplayName,\n                        \" \",\n                        OperationName,\n                        \" \",\n                        Identity,\n                        \" \",\n                        tostring(InitiatedBy),\n                        \" \",\n                        tostring(TargetResources),\n                        \" \",\n                        tostring(AdditionalDetails),\n                        \" \",\n                        LoggedByService,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceProvider,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceId,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResultDescription\n                    )\n                ),\n            Evidence =\n                strcat(\n                    \"Activity=\",\n                    ActivityDisplayName,\n                    \"; Operation=\",\n                    OperationName,\n                    \"; Identity=\",\n                    Identity,\n                    \"; InitiatedBy=\",\n                    tostring(InitiatedBy),\n                    \"; TargetResources=\",\n                    tostring(TargetResources),\n                    \"; Result=\",\n                    ResultType,\n                    \"; Description=\",\n                    ResultDescription\n                )\n        | project\n            ObservedTable = \"AuditLogs\",\n            EventTime,\n            RecordId,\n            Actor,\n            ActorIP,\n            OperationText,\n            ResourceText,\n            SearchText,\n            Evidence\n    ),\n    (\n        // Microsoft Entra service-principal sign-ins\n        AADServicePrincipalSignInLogs\n        | where TimeGenerated between (\n            {TimeRange:start}\n            ..\n            {TimeRange:end}\n        )\n        | extend\n            EventTime = TimeGenerated,\n            RecordId = tostring(Id),\n            Actor = tostring(coalesce(ServicePrincipalName, ServicePrincipalId, AppId, Identity)),\n            ActorIP = tostring(IPAddress),\n            OperationText = tostring(OperationName),\n            ResourceText = tostring(coalesce(ResourceDisplayName, ResourceIdentity, ResourceServicePrincipalId)),\n            SearchText =\n                tolower(\n                    strcat(\n                        ServicePrincipalName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ServicePrincipalId,\n                        \" \",\n                        AppId,\n                        \" \",\n                        Identity,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceDisplayName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResourceIdentity,\n                        \" \",\n                        Agent,\n                        \" \",\n                        OperationName,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResultType,\n                        \" \",\n                        ResultDescription,\n                        \" \",\n                        UserAgent\n                    )\n                ),\n            Evidence =\n                strcat(\n                    \"ServicePrincipal=\",\n                    ServicePrincipalName,\n                    \"; ServicePrincipalId=\",\n                    ServicePrincipalId,\n                    \"; AppId=\",\n                    AppId,\n                    \"; Resource=\",\n                    ResourceDisplayName,\n                    \"; Result=\",\n                    ResultType,\n                    \"; Description=\",\n                    ResultDescription,\n                    \"; UserAgent=\",\n                    UserAgent\n                )\n        | project\n            ObservedTable = \"AADServicePrincipalSignInLogs\",\n            EventTime,\n            RecordId,\n            Actor,\n            ActorIP,\n            OperationText,\n            ResourceText,\n            SearchText,\n            Evidence\n    );\n// ============================================================\n// BUILD CLOUD SEARCH LIST\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudPatterns =\n    toscalar(\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | summarize make_set(SearchPattern, 500)\n    );\n// ============================================================\n// CANDIDATE CLOUD EVENTS\n// ============================================================\nlet CandidateCloudEvents =\n    CloudEvents\n    | where EventTime between (\n        {TimeRange:start}\n        ..\n        {TimeRange:end}\n    )\n    | where isnotempty(SearchText)\n    | where SearchText has_any(CloudPatterns)\n    | extend\n        EventKey =\n            strcat(\n                ObservedTable,\n                \"|\",\n                RecordId,\n                \"|\",\n                tostring(EventTime),\n                \"|\",\n                Actor,\n                \"|\",\n                OperationText\n            );\n// ============================================================\n// MATCH CLOUD WATCHLIST\n// ============================================================\nlet CloudMatches =\n    CandidateCloudEvents\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\n    | join kind=inner (\n        AgentWatchlist\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\n    ) on JoinKey\n    | where SearchText contains SearchPattern\n    | summarize\n        arg_max(EventTime, *)\n      by\n        EventKey,\n        AgentKey,\n        Vendor,\n        Pattern,\n        SourceFrom;\n// ============================================================\n// SUMMARISE BY NORMALIZED CLOUD AGENT\n// ============================================================\nCloudMatches\n| summarize\n    AgentName = take_any(Name),\n    AgentVendor = take_any(Vendor),\n    AgentCategory = take_any(Category),\n    AgentFrom = take_any(SourceFrom),\n    AgentTelemetrySource = take_any(TelemetrySource),\n    AgentRiskLevel = take_any(RiskLevel),\n    AgentDefaultAction = take_any(DefaultAction),\n    AgentReason = take_any(Reason),\n    FirstSeen = min(EventTime),\n    LastSeen = max(EventTime),\n    Events = dcount(EventKey),\n    Users = dcount(Actor),\n    TableCount = dcount(ObservedTable),\n    UserList = make_set_if(Actor, isnotempty(Actor), 30),\n    IPList = make_set_if(ActorIP, isnotempty(ActorIP), 30),\n    ObservedTableList = make_set(ObservedTable, 20),\n    Operations = make_set(OperationText, 30),\n    Resources = make_set(ResourceText, 30),\n    Patterns = make_set(Pattern, 50),\n    Sources = make_set(SourceURL, 10),\n    ExampleActor = take_any(Actor),\n    ExampleOperation = take_any(OperationText),\n    ExampleResource = take_any(ResourceText),\n    ExampleEvidence = take_any(Evidence)\n  by\n    AgentKey\n// ============================================================\n// DISPLAY RISK AND OUTPUT\n// ============================================================\n| extend\n    IsSanctioned =\n        array_length(SelectedAgentKeys) > 0\n        and set_has_element(SelectedAgentKeys, tolower(AgentKey))\n| extend\n    Governance =\n        iff(\n            IsSanctioned,\n            \"🟢 Sanctioned\",\n            \"🔴 Unsanctioned\"\n        ),\n    Risk =\n        case(\n            AgentRiskLevel =~ \"High\",\n                \"🔴 High\",\n            AgentRiskLevel =~ \"Medium\",\n                \"🟠 Medium\",\n            AgentRiskLevel =~ \"Low\",\n                \"🟡 Low\",\n            strcat(\"⚪ \", tostring(AgentRiskLevel))\n        ),\n    RiskOrder =\n        case(\n            AgentRiskLevel =~ \"High\",\n                1,\n            AgentRiskLevel =~ \"Medium\",\n                2,\n            AgentRiskLevel =~ \"Low\",\n                3,\n            4\n        ),\n    ObservedTables =\n        strcat_array(\n            ObservedTableList,\n            \", \"\n        ),\n    PatternList =\n        strcat_array(\n            Patterns,\n            \", \"\n        )\n| project\n    Tool = AgentName,\n    Vendor = AgentVendor,\n    ['From'] = AgentFrom,\n    ['Telemetry Source'] = AgentTelemetrySource,\n    ['Observed Tables'] = ObservedTables,\n    ['Policy Mapping'] =\n        iff(\n            IsSanctioned,\n            \"Sanctioned\",\n            \"Unsanctioned\"\n        ),\n    Governance,\n    Risk,\n    Category = AgentCategory,\n    Users,\n    Tables = TableCount,\n    ['User List'] = UserList,\n    ['IP List'] = IPList,\n    Operations,\n    Resources,\n    Pattern = PatternList,\n    Sources,\n    Actor = ExampleActor,\n    Operation = ExampleOperation,\n    Resource = ExampleResource,\n    Events,\n    ['First Seen'] = FirstSeen,\n    ['Last Seen'] = LastSeen,\n    DefaultAction = AgentDefaultAction,\n    Reason = AgentReason,\n    Evidence = ExampleEvidence,\n    RiskOrder\n| order by\n    RiskOrder asc,\n    Users desc,\n    Events desc,\n    ['Last Seen'] desc\n| project-away RiskOrder",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "☁️ [Cloud] AI Agent / Tool Detection, count: {$rowCount}",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{ws}"
              ],
              "gridSettings": {
                "filter": true
              },
              "sortBy": []
            },
            "name": "query - 3"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "\n## 🤖 Understanding the AI Agent Detection Results\n\nThese reports compare observed activity against the maintained AI agent detection catalogue and the selected sanctioned-agent policy.\n\nThe **Local** report uses endpoint process telemetry to identify local agents, model hosts, and agent tooling through process names and command lines. The **Cloud** report uses available audit and identity telemetry, including Microsoft 365, Entra, Purview, Defender, and service-principal activity.\n\nResults are grouped into one row per detected agent. Each row includes the affected users, devices or tables, observed operations, evidence, first and last seen times, risk level, and recommended default action.\n\nRisk and action values come from the detection catalogue and support investigation. They do not determine whether an agent is sanctioned or unsanctioned; that classification comes from the selected sanctioned-agent policies.\n\n### Catalogue and Governance Watchlist\n\nThe public `ai_agent_watchlist.csv` catalogue is used to match local and cloud AI agents and tools.\n\nThe optional local governance file `ai_agent_governance_watchlist.csv` is uploaded to Sentinel as the **AIAgentGovernance** watchlist. It contains customer-specific governance entries and sanctioned selections, using the `Key` column as the Sentinel SearchKey. It does not replace the public detection catalogue.\n\n### Log Sources\n\n- **DeviceProcessEvents** — Local agent, model-host, process-name, and command-line activity.\n- **OfficeActivity** — Microsoft 365 and Purview audit activity.\n- **AuditLogs** — Microsoft Entra audit activity.\n- **AADServicePrincipalSignInLogs** — Microsoft Entra service-principal sign-in activity.\n\nCloud sources are queried opportunistically; unavailable tables are ignored."
            },
            "name": "text - AI Agent Tool Summary"
          }
        ]
      },
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "selectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "agents"
      },
      "name": "group - agents"
    }
  ],
  "fromTemplateId": "sentinel-UserWorkbook",
  "$schema": "https://github.com/Microsoft/Application-Insights-Workbooks/blob/master/schema/workbook.json"
}